{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:37.757804+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 94.12s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('2e92a7425c47482a889c852c61836533', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333948, 1, 'Man of Science, Man of Faith', \"Jack, Locke and Kate explore the mysterious hatch but Jack decides to wait before going down into the hatch. Kate and Locke aren't so patient. When Shannon chases after Vincent the dog, she encounters a familiar face in the jungle.\", '2005-09-21', 44, 8.9, 82, '/iYa49CTksqoa9DI5hVHW2hT8NCg.jpg', None, '72fe9368b03243da8738576cef2859fc', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333949, 2, 'Adrift', \"With the abduction of Walt fresh on their minds, their raft destroyed, and Jin missing, Michael and Sawyer fight for their lives in the middle of now ... (263 characters truncated) ... veal more of Michael's troubled relationship with ex-lover Susan and their baby son Walt as they fight over custody for Walt and Michael must let go.\", '2005-09-28', 43, 8.2, 75, '/1DRWfizlphvhmOv2nBgyXdWZ7Fd.jpg', None, 'd7f55dc94c67402da81a851997974400', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333950, 3, 'Orientation', \"Michael, Sawyer, and Jin find themselves prisoners after they encounter what they believe to be a group of Others. At the Hatch, the group learns more about their new surroundings but are confused at Desmond's reaction when the strange computer equipment is broken.\", '2005-10-05', 44, 8.4, 75, '/bZKY3An6zqKL6mL5tki5LGITdFz.jpg', None, 'c27e701fc7444168aa42ef73dd16c3a2', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333951, 4, 'Everybody Hates Hugo', 'Hurley struggles with an assigned task inside the hatch as he flashbacks to disturbing memories in his life before the crash. Meanwhile, Sawyer, Michael and Jin learn the identities of their captors on the island. Claire uncovers a startling piece of information about the fate of the raft.', '2005-10-12', 44, 8.1, 76, '/vbhnJonNExFdstKCDw0dQq1TBYS.jpg', None, '6c0f06e2680f4c218615626b9a35f2a5', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/zeI9Gl9X3o8MRayQ4Z5wvtfsqr2.jpg', None, '38f6770f9fbd469ea0f992a640996104', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333967, 21, '?', 'Mr. Eko has dreams about his brother leading him somewhere. He seeks Locke\\'s help in finding a secret location, the \"question mark.\" Meanwhile, Jack and the other survivors grapple with the horrific situation in the hatch with the death of Ana-Lucia and Libby clinging to life.', '2006-05-10', 47, 8.6, 65, '/cJic70Ou9ErDCxOCYLsKWCCeNET.jpg', None, '6bf3c28f28204cf4a2f74cbd20cd8aa2', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333968, 22, 'Three Minutes', 'A determined Michael convinces Jack and several castaways to help him rescue Walt from \"The Others.\" With Jack away, Locke is left in charge of the h ... (121 characters truncated) ... ts that happened to Michael after he left are finally revealed. Meanwhile, Charlie struggles with Eko\\'s decision to discontinue building the church.', '2006-05-17', 46, 8.3, 64, '/7FR5K3DRfnYPvjjoJIEpfhZNbkq.jpg', None, '65f5be9398df44c0b55ac93add8b260f', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333969, 23, 'Live Together, Die Alone (1)', 'After discovering something odd just offshore, Jack and Sayid come up with a plan to confront \"The Others\" and hopefully get Walt back. At the same t ... (230 characters truncated) ... astly, Desmond returns and he sheds some more light on his experience on the island in the three years prior to when Locke came down into that hatch.', '2006-05-24', 44, 9.0, 65, '/cNyTL5PS7yTd0cXHRLxT0cY6GWx.jpg', None, 'b584e0f7fbd349b59fd4691c10b52fd9', 'b949f5b6b6c841e187907d552d0856f1', 333971, 24, 'Live Together, Die Alone (2)', 'After discovering something odd just offshore, Jack and Sayid come up with a plan to confront \"The Others\" and hopefully get Walt back. Meanwhile, Eko and Locke come to blows as Locke makes a potentially cataclysmic decision regarding the \"button\" and the hatch.', '2006-05-24', 44, 8.9, 31, '/rhkkSahgABiiQmSMcUx5RJBOfgA.jpg', None)"}
