{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:37.910255+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 94.27s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('5f4ebcd2d20a427a8b8bfe561e4adfb0', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333974, 1, 'A Tale of Two Cities', 'Jack, Kate, and Sawyer are prisoners of the mysterious \"Others.\" After their captors drug them and take blood samples, they are held in separate area ... (69 characters truncated) ... Juliet--try to make the castaways adjust to their new circumstances.\\n\\nFlashbacks reveal more about Jack\\'s past with his father and his wife Sarah.', '2006-10-04', 43, 8.3, 60, '/t2KSe1biVE3svtuIF4eZHGmlNcc.jpg', None, 'd87ef907c12c4e76a1ac97d7e1bd28ab', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333972, 2, 'The Glass Ballerina', 'Sun and Jin\\'s lives are put in danger when Sayid tries to locate Jack and the other missing castaways. Sayid also creates a plan in order to get the ... (99 characters truncated) ... ry tempting in exchange for his cooperation. Lastly, Kate and Sawyer must adjust to harsh conditions that are being forced upon them by \"The Others.\"', '2006-10-11', 43, 8.0, 58, '/iqAiXw01fdiYlBkthLDMmK14hnn.jpg', None, 'a600e80287674dcda21a74a7dd1569a3', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333973, 3, 'Further Instructions', 'Locke, Eko and Desmond are found scattered about the island after the implosion of the hatch. Locke receives a message from the Island asking him to  ... (77 characters truncated) ... e imprisonment of Kate, Jack and Sawyer by the Others.\\n\\nDesmond has been fundamentally altered by the implosion, giving him a mysterious new power.', '2006-10-18', 42, 7.9, 58, '/8BHjUdTMhzq2jP6LT5imt7yHvWN.jpg', None, 'd41c60a74b6d4dbb9c562bc5ce924874', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333975, 4, 'Every Man for Himself', \"The Others prevent Sawyer and Kate from escaping, leaving Sawyer perplexed by the extent of the measures taken to keep them imprisoned. Jack is asked ... (23 characters truncated) ... ining to save the life of one of the Others. At the beach, Desmond's strange behavior attracts attention. He begins to construct a mysterious device.\", '2006-10-25', 43, 8.2, 58, '/kZ2EKUchoJmidlDNIaudnoOnURz.jpg', None, '239c375b715a4a64933973f1a92193e2', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4' ... 176 parameters truncated ... '/nuG9ijqfhsZ1mApoiiarvcHhdqp.jpg', None, '14fec4a23c5446038edc127a479913dd', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333991, 20, 'The Man Behind the Curtain', \"Ben unwillingly divulges information to Locke about the island, taking him on a journey to various locations including strange monuments and the myst ... (12 characters truncated) ... . Back at the beach, Juliet's secret is revealed. Flashbacks will show us the origins of DHARMA and the history of the island, including 'the purge.'\", '2007-05-09', 43, 8.9, 56, '/mX8CcYejTm7sLRnAXev7WBmhjG1.jpg', None, '5cf933e7318f405d95a498397829e6c0', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333992, 21, 'Greatest Hits', 'While Jack devises a plan to do away with \"The Others\" once and for all, Sayid uncovers a flaw in \"The Others\\'\" system that could lead to everyone\\'s rescue. But it requires Charlie to take on a dangerous task that may make Desmond\\'s premonition come true.\\n\\nA Charlie-centric episode.', '2007-05-16', 43, 8.9, 55, '/yxgIh9F1fUOT719jCFxApqSZpgv.jpg', None, 'c16415c77711445ea4a46c379e5aa45f', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333993, 22, 'Through the Looking Glass (1)', 'The season 3 finale finds the castaways preparing for an invasion by the slightly less mysterious Others, while Charlie and Desmond find more than they were looking for in the underwater \"Looking Glass Hatch\".', '2007-05-23', 43, 9.1, 68, '/1dMaeUO9to7MAhyuQoUEyvZxcoD.jpg', None, '19bd89ec0254411886a4fdc72ab526fd', '7c9994164b1a47ec84b6adfbb484b5b4', 333994, 23, 'Through the Looking Glass (2)', 'The season 3 finale finds the castaways preparing for an invasion by the slightly less mysterious Others, while Charlie and Desmond find more than they were looking for in the underwater \"Looking Glass Hatch\".', '2007-05-23', 43, 9.3, 31, '/718PhF8a7ME95W9KGlbjKQ1E4j1.jpg', None)"}
