{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:38.264427+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 94.63s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('0fcdcd18bee7419b95589b86dde6a3c7', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334009, 1, 'Because You Left', \"The remaining island survivors start to feel the effects of the aftermath of moving the island, and Jack and Ben begin their quest to reunite the Oceanic 6 in order to return to the island with Locke's body in an attempt to save their former fellow castaways.\", '2009-01-21', 43, 8.3, 55, '/1nK0aMTPDYbf7xLUzxoCIcs4rCf.jpg', None, 'ec20a00952504de2ad91bd46eb18bba7', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334012, 2, 'The Lie', 'Hurley and Sayid are on the run from the cops after stumbling into trouble at the safehouse; the island survivors come under attack by unknown forces; and an old friend offers some shocking advice to Kate in order to ensure that \"the lie\" remain a secret.', '2009-01-21', 42, 8.0, 52, '/r6S0EXvuic4ZfDaYN9sx5y1Hzm5.jpg', None, '7a90fbdcd7be42738db138acb4e90d8b', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334010, 3, 'Jughead', \"Desmond looks for a woman who might be the key to helping Faraday stop the island's unpredictable movements through time; Locke finds out who has been attacking the survivors.\", '2009-01-28', 43, 8.4, 54, '/A12DC54BQPupiYhQSK3ljDE7r4Z.jpg', None, '848284f4628b4b8982dda2aeaae2c26e', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334025, 4, 'The Little Prince', \"Kate discovers that someone knows the secret of Aaron's true parental lineage. Meanwhile, the dramatic shifts through time are placing the lives of the remaining island survivors in extreme peril.\", '2009-02-04', 43, 8.1, 51, '/46fNBqpEv5GaOvaDQ1ir0NUT3Yb.jpg', None, '6c0212bd00184df48f774aa0dfc2867d', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb' ... 104 parameters truncated ... '/5vBNhWMezf4rhxDVkInxj5fkFIj.jpg', None, '5a9ba83171f944b19e9a9cd5bd7c9af8', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334021, 14, 'The Variable', 'On the 100th episode milestone for the series, the time of reckoning has begun when Daniel Faraday comes clean regarding what he knows about the island.', '2009-04-29', 43, 8.6, 51, '/cY5hknSnjAxgPRNURXeST2QVuRV.jpg', None, 'b0e67fca5e344a8e8e83deadeee4bcb2', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334022, 15, 'Follow the Leader', 'Jack and Kate find themselves at odds over the direction to take to save their fellow island survivors, Locke further solidifies his stance as leader of \"The Others,\" and Sawyer and Juliet come under scrutiny from the Dharma Initiative.', '2009-05-06', 43, 8.5, 52, '/afAxj0X1hNJJyXZXCsyNQNwhmy1.jpg', None, 'af2e6119e73545b2a131ceac703f71e1', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334024, 16, 'The Incident (1)', \"Jack's decision to put a plan in action in order to set things right on the island is met with some strong resistance by those close to him, and Locke assigns Ben a difficult task.\", '2009-05-13', 46, 8.9, 55, '/sTEhGjqKrxySpBsJ6lk30uz3oqR.jpg', None, '58ee5291af2e416d8f7f822fbe10e994', '4792cce0b9954d70bce44fa5ce5e58eb', 334023, 17, 'The Incident (2)', \"Jack's decision to put a plan in action in order to set things right on the island is met with some strong resistance by those close to him, and Locke assigns Ben a difficult task.\", '2009-05-13', 42, 8.9, 51, '/oilgn20L4OusxqzkbTYO71k7qR1.jpg', None)"}
