{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:38.403942+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 94.77s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f7a59dc0b5f3443498263a0598252738', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334026, 1, 'LA X (1)', \"Two outcomes of the detonation of the hydrogen bomb are presented. Flight 815 lands safely at LAX, where Kate escapes from the marshal and Jack learns that his father's body was lost in transit.\", '2010-02-02', 44, 8.4, 58, '/ggwkEkASEWpy22vtpqlVatkqcHe.jpg', None, '052621fa6b244eb49925096595961217', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334027, 2, 'LA X (2)', \"Jack, Sawyer, Kate, Miles and Hurley, struggling to save Sayid, face an ancient secret. Meanwhile, a fake Locke exits the chamber to everyone's awe.\", '2010-02-02', 43, 8.3, 47, '/mTEAXrAiq7SI1ls0MBNrfmp6tgy.jpg', None, '4c45a803429f40dab6c134b2fbd45261', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334028, 3, 'What Kate Does', 'When Sawyer escapes from the temple, Kate and Jin are sent to bring him back. Meanwhile, the Others determine Sayid is infected and attempt to poison him. In the flash sideways, Kate, still on the run, takes Claire to a hospital when she goes into labor.', '2010-02-09', 43, 7.8, 53, '/biy9BpoYUDHf2rDcYXhFK3eDndm.jpg', None, 'cf0335d48d8445008a62a0dd63af3b1d', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334029, 4, 'The Substitute', 'On the island, the Man in Black attempts to recruit Sawyer in his attempt to leave the island, while an impromptu funeral is held for the real Locke. In the flash sideways, Locke is fired from his job and becomes a substitute teacher.', '2010-02-16', 44, 8.3, 50, '/xMe5ap7JdgjLpo3JiN7xD1JCAWy.jpg', None, '3e81bfd333d748a18a741e223389dd6f', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a' ... 104 parameters truncated ... '/aDzuHEMUJjOFdzznk1QmwMCuq5e.jpg', None, 'c55762dbd3bc46cb91fb5571de2e1c94', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334039, 14, 'The Candidate', \"After the remaining survivors are reunited, Sawyer and Jack hatch a plan to divert the Man in Black's attention and leave the island without him on W ... (4 characters truncated) ... re's submarine, but disastrous consequences await them. In the flash sideways, Jack investigates the cause of Locke's paralysis and offers treatment.\", '2010-05-04', 44, 8.8, 59, '/bOyeroN1vsOZvzNNvkhk16Oehbh.jpg', None, 'db63a6f919a34ec8a79dfb3458bc0f71', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334040, 15, 'Across the Sea', 'When Claudia, a heavily pregnant woman, washes ashore, support is at hand in the form of a stranger. But her intentions for Claudia and the unborn twins are unknown.', '2010-05-11', 44, 8.1, 55, '/imcNBmcpZB9EDfxOGiQipQXhto9.jpg', None, '8e95dcf25b904d6f935c7b8d08722fd1', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334041, 16, 'What They Died For', 'Jacob appears to the survivors of the submarine explosion and tells them what they were chosen for. Ben joins forces with Locke, as they both have a final showdown with Charles Widmore.', '2010-05-18', 44, 8.5, 54, '/vbYH810PRjM36SI3oCNSGY1AeWw.jpg', None, '8082fa5de175414ebccb56abdb1b3491', '3e15b2267b124460829ca59ca40b0a5a', 334042, 17, 'The End', 'On the Island, Jack and the Man in Black play out their last moves as the survivors make their final choices, and the true nature of the flash sideways is revealed.', '2010-05-23', 105, 8.3, 71, '/eNuO8GqCuRb0fAeQDAh2w5AaXTo.jpg', None)"}
