{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:38.684122+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 95.05s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('66843877f71c42b8bce99688fba5d2b8', '1f674b6eed6a43a39c240c072f1f390b', 1537696, 1, 'Part One', 'In the spring of 1989, five boys of color are arrested, interrogated and coerced into confessing to the vicious attack of a woman in Central Park.', '2019-05-31', 65, 7.574, 54, '/h2cqbOwbPH6W9GWxQ4nvTSxitjd.jpg', None, '53aad785151746bd9c3ba22bd164b43d', '1f674b6eed6a43a39c240c072f1f390b', 1537838, 2, 'Part Two', 'As the jogger case stirs tensions nationwide, the families of the boys and their lawyers prepare for a bitter legal fight against the city of New York.', '2019-05-31', 72, 7.489, 47, '/bcRzUAqISiHVSsJdQlLYimLFN0W.jpg', None, '49e2398545054da29c80c515e92fec8b', '1f674b6eed6a43a39c240c072f1f390b', 1537839, 3, 'Part Three', 'The boys struggle with the difficult reality of life behind bars. Years later, Raymond, Antron, Yusef and Kevin return home as men to a changed world.', '2019-05-31', 74, 7.644, 45, '/njxWiBpOklUgffQ8okYDQEcVEJM.jpg', None, '4399d3ab9c6345b8856814a4d20bcfb5', '1f674b6eed6a43a39c240c072f1f390b', 1537840, 4, 'Part Four', 'At age 16, Korey begins a brutal journey through the adult prison system. A shocking turn of events reveals the truth of the crime, long ignored.', '2019-05-31', 89, 8.043, 46, '/qH6Lm3BB53vkJdnO2GdJusj6rLT.jpg', None)"}
