{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:39.384059+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 95.75s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bc801b26ebdd407fb132a43be286a5e3', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1036343, 1, 'Alive in Tucson', 'He has traveled to every city, every town and every outpost in the United States, Mexico and Canada, and has found no one. As he returns to his hometown of Tucson, Phil comes to the realization that he is almost certainly the last living being on the face of the earth.', '2015-03-01', 22, 7.733, 45, '/T42vslju3FPcSpJRMPgT4zdiBY.jpg', None, '1bbd137b0824418d84fc72589b815edb', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1036345, 2, 'The Elephant in the Room', \"Phil finds out he's not the last person left on Earth, but things aren't as wonderful as he would have hoped.\", '2015-03-01', 22, 7.75, 8, '/aGH8e2eDpWu2AdK2vMp7kDALxPb.jpg', None, 'cdc7da32391d4c81aeecedb87d6d86c5', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1036346, 3, 'Raisin Balls and Wedding Bells', \"Phil's prayers have been answered—sort of—now that he has found the last woman on earth, Carol.  He finds himself back among human existence, and somehow engaged to be married.\", '2015-03-08', 22, 7.438, 32, '/ppLVXiyqdZETfbyEs3hDdyDeXcz.jpg', None, '4f5cd8779fa94ccca5e633fec382c21c', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1036347, 4, 'Sweet Melissa', 'Phil and Carol are shocked to find Melissa, another survivor, just after Phil reluctantly agreed to marry Carol. Phil finds himself in a pickle and has to work fast in order to save human existence.', '2015-03-15', 22, 7.143, 28, '/1x4hh3zX3pYyefLm9RJr74vqZjG.jpg', None, '0cabb29ce9314166a118f1d40eb67318', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/bhFLXpVLSBKgdy9Dq90DRiQbjWZ.jpg', None, 'ed8f4abd7e4b4f2f92dfcf96bb413dd7', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1053016, 10, \"Pranks for Nothin'\", 'Everyone is mad at Phil for lying as they refuse to speak to Phil, and he is shunned. Carol also holds a grudge against Erica and Gail. Phil confront ... (57 characters truncated) ... luding the fact that he never wanted to marry Carol. Carol, who is a notary, divorces Phil, then forgives him and invites him back to the cul-de-sac.', '2015-04-12', 22, 7.313, 16, '/tLlk9KBV3Ax0Hh0DkFFOu9C8TTu.jpg', None, '05432b710c1944929304d26d392e93ce', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1052886, 11, 'Moved to Tampa', 'Phil Miller continues his life.', '2015-04-19', 22, 7.125, 16, '/7CbIWwotSOD5CXpkJk4KUepaL5o.jpg', None, '38c6615ccdd94ae78f5ec0b095b59683', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1050953, 12, 'The Tandyman Can', 'The cul de sac decides to have a re-election for the President of the United States.', '2015-04-26', 22, 7.133, 15, '/qWIQnaEdnDN9qsDGS1ZzghZxSmM.jpg', None, '291325c82284401a8a140f36c572e349', '1fd1fbf0dd3e488687709c609c01d045', 1052887, 13, 'Screw the Moon', 'Phil and Carol reconcile their differences.', '2015-05-03', 22, 7.938, 16, '/oFOD4sh2RCXiJIPiPfspQhvWgJ5.jpg', None)"}
