{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:39.837748+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 96.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('caefdfeadc154bb2a45a83d26db762c1', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1373197, 1, 'M.U.B.A.R.', 'A new woman joins the group and tries to find her place while everybody else prepares to set sail for Mexico.', '2017-10-01', 22, 7.9, 7, '/wB9nJIGjAGX732juMZc939QbAf4.jpg', None, '8786bd9479ce4f859ea9d35933a9261b', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1377513, 2, 'Stocko Syndrome', 'Tandy devises an escape plan to get away from Pamela and back to Carol and the others. Meanwhile, the rest of the gang encounters a castaway, Glenn, who has been stranded on an island for years.', '2017-10-08', 22, 7.2, 5, '/pCq74AylGXnyQnicSwmprVbqB0c.jpg', None, '6002a21fd1084cca8e2eb545ab3a0654', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1380319, 3, 'Skeleton Crew', \"Pamela tries desperately to redeem herself with everyone, as the gang finally reaches Mexico. Meanwhile, Todd is disappointed that Zihuatanejo is not the paradise of which he'd dreamed.\", '2017-10-15', 22, 7.2, 5, '/gzaFRCjDHfq9YS5CovbeN6JqtIp.jpg', None, 'e8419b1a1bf04e3c8ebb6a78e65be48f', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1382897, 4, 'Wisconsin', 'Carol panics when Todd and Melissa leave for their honeymoon, and Erica and Gail decide to live on their own for a while.', '2017-10-22', 22, 6.5, 4, '/xuArI62SRbIoq3WzHgm7qH2Wrq9.jpg', None, 'bd2042f273be4f1dbe25653c9453ec2c', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042' ... 116 parameters truncated ... '/r4sBvt9RU6Icf4GLFWIN7BqvhjJ.jpg', None, '5ff8e34adc9a49908059fdf44167eddd', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1462069, 15, 'Designated Survivors', 'Tandy wakes up to a shocking discovery that is positive for everyone in the group, but it throws Todd into a spiral. Meanwhile, Todd and Erica share an emotional roller coaster.', '2018-04-15', 22, 7.3, 6, '/fSRrK6IrqUhqXWu7rRduUjAY5xl.jpg', None, 'f64e9f0ca916407fa056a6ba1f182695', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1462070, 16, 'The Blob', \"A thermal heat detector reveals a potential sign of life outside of the Zihuatanejo village, but Tandy doesn't want the group to split up to go investigate. Meanwhile, Todd and Erica have trouble seeing eye-to-eye.\", '2018-04-22', 22, 6.8, 6, '/caP0F4bA0ryDk64zpEIfjEcfQzq.jpg', None, '9e5b564d63ba452f82327f2f69eaa514', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1465388, 17, 'Barbara Ann', 'The gang ventures out in search of what they think could be a new sign of life, but are surprised at what they actually find. Meanwhile, Todd makes a few morbid discoveries of his own back at the mansion.', '2018-04-29', 22, 7.8, 4, '/oxyJFVQF0Q1gaxg9B6Ns64cNWbj.jpg', None, 'def72f0c6f9a440792badcc408c6913f', '1c650511f0ad48acaafc7dd88d002042', 1479475, 18, 'Cancun, Baby!', 'The gang decides to leave the mansion in Zihuatenajo and find a new place to live, but Tandy has second thoughts.', '2018-05-06', 22, 8.1, 7, '/kthPztIngrGRrTRdwXmKQHx6COq.jpg', None)"}
