{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:45.552698+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 101.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('6385d86c1a7440a6b69ec77b8fe57a3d', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771036, 1, 'Game Change', \"Nikita and Michael plot to take down Division and Oversight and are prepared to use the contents of the black box to do so. Amanda is now running Div ... (207 characters truncated) ... efuses until Amanda tells her she will help her find the man who killed Alex's father. Meanwhile, Nikita and Michael find help from an unlikely ally.\", '2011-09-23', 43, 8.3, 15, '/oADbHXw60EHl2QQdwXsE4YMPM6E.jpg', None, '684b99d8bb61462089fc0a7bea925f07', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771038, 2, 'Falling Ash', 'While investigating an old corrupt Division program, P9, that seems to have resurfaced, Nikita and Michael run into Owen. He tells them he is searchi ... (119 characters truncated) ... n himself off the dangerous drug. Michael is hesitant to trust Owen again but Nikita decides the three should join forces. Percy demands to see Alex.', '2011-09-30', 43, 8.1, 10, '/vMMxz1BrXXNattz4xRZamyItWjj.jpg', None, '95ac2a8dbc9b4cefa38b6cc3f43b860a', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771037, 3, 'Knightfall', \"Birkoff tells Nikita and Michael that a black box file reveals that an international terrorist named Ramon, who has been taking credit for some serio ... (252 characters truncated) ...  plans to let Ramon take the credit for the murder. However, when Nikita disrupts Amanda's plan, Amanda fights back by taking what Nikita loves most.\", '2011-10-07', 43, 8.3, 10, '/uw9xQLpXl1Cusa2ZHsv3NTLj449.jpg', None, '240037657c3f4019ba81504692ea608d', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771039, 4, 'Partners', 'Nikita is stunned when she hears that her old Division partner Kelly escaped from a Turkish prison. Nikita thought Kelly died years ago and always fe ... (113 characters truncated) ... r Kelly, Nikita tells Michael they have to go to Turkey to help her. Amanda sends Alex and Roan to Europe to stop the former partners from reuniting.', '2011-10-14', 43, 8.3, 10, '/cSjk8dHw5qKZX4eR3boGMuFqxst.jpg', None, '6d77eeef4cdc4ad891df26ccc4668b31', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339' ... 176 parameters truncated ... '/bZcKiZGUPN20zrwqKKQ1ayfJu7S.jpg', None, '44c5da4fc8a1461284107166f099322d', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771055, 20, 'Shadow Walker', 'Nikita convinces a reluctant Birkhoff to use 20 million dollars of his own money in a plan to bankrupt Percy and Division, but when Percy ends up ste ... (188 characters truncated) ... zes she must break him out of jail before Division gets to him. Michael and Alex go after Birkhoff’s stolen money while Nikita goes to save Birkhoff.', '2012-04-27', 43, 8.8, 10, '/8Swx03RnOd06WFZlyZPSTK1tT7u.jpg', None, 'f4c4ba6e06614ed691e403a3647bad3f', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771056, 21, 'Dead Drop', 'When it looks like Percy’s nuclear weapons plan is getting out of control, Ryan suggests they go to the Director of the CIA, Morgan Kendrick, for hel ... (105 characters truncated) ... alate when Nikita is proven right after they discover Kendrick has a link to Percy. Meanwhile, Sean is shot by Percy’s men, shaking Alex to the core.', '2012-05-04', 43, 8.5, 10, '/umDbwsHNvmE2wINJ6PNg6sQplGb.jpg', None, '9f198b7a2b3842cc8cc93d4bb503256a', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771057, 22, 'Crossbow', 'Percy calls the President the United States and threatens to set off a nuclear explosion unless his demands are met. Birkhoff finds two scientists wh ... (193 characters truncated) ... cy blows up as an example of his power. Meanwhile, Nikita realizes the best way to stop Percy is to go into the belly of the beast – Division itself.', '2012-05-11', 43, 8.7, 10, '/JOQ8RjmYa1MizcgLUHD90CHWYy.jpg', None, 'ef0ee698377c4ce39f4453da7ac8a1d2', 'ee72d36898ce4276a4f331987cd22339', 771058, 23, 'Homecoming', 'Nikita and Michael invade Division in an attempt to capture Percy. Alex and Sean get caught in a deadly gunfire battle with the U.S. Marines and Ryan ... (185 characters truncated) ... eign. Meanwhile, Birkhoff asks Sonya for help, and Nikita corners Percy in his office, but he pulls out one final trick that may cost her the battle.', '2012-05-18', 43, 8.5, 11, '/xc2Q5RYzps31RquD8TFBWDAaG3M.jpg', None)"}
