{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:45.899650+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 102.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('751c2ab0e665469289f349f648a16a8c', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771014, 1, '3.0', 'Ryan takes charge of Division with Nikita by his side. Their first mission under the new regime is to bring in “The Dirty Thirty,” the rogue agents w ... (317 characters truncated) ... rt of the plan to spring Michael. Meanwhile, Birkhoff struggles to maintain a working relationship with Sonya, despite his growing attraction to her.', '2012-10-19', 43, 8.3, 11, '/2vYoPMJuK03UpxDrIFFYwx0yQcM.jpg', None, '5e675dbb190048a98cecdb1cd462e74f', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771015, 2, 'Innocence', 'Nikita, Michael and team extract a young girl named Liza, who is being held captive by a rogue Division agent, Wade. Wade has brainwashed Liza and tr ... (234 characters truncated) ... ission to unleash a deadly chemical into the UN building during a special event. Meanwhile, Liza’s abduction brings up painful old memories for Alex.', '2012-10-26', 43, 8.5, 11, '/4hkKQK6QlzTzdiUCL1j71yVhj0b.jpg', None, 'c180f715ae754ea2818616248df9c9f5', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771016, 3, 'True Believer', 'When Ryan tells Nikita an undercover agent has been arrested and they need to extract her from prison, Nikita questions why Division is continuing to ... (28 characters truncated) ... ikita, Michael and Sean attempt to stop a terrorist attack but are one man down after Alex is shot. Meanwhile, Birkhoff and Sonia continue to bicker.', '2012-11-02', 42, 8.3, 11, '/po3nAKLG4jLwJ1uaQALPVchDSVy.jpg', None, '6cc33a0ba0224387959bf493ff5d4a7c', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771017, 4, 'Consequences', 'Amanda sends a rogue Division agent, Anne to spring Owen from a Russian prison, but Owen manages to escape her clutches and sends a message to Nikita ... (66 characters truncated) ... earn that Nikita is with Division now but returns to base with her. Michael and Ryan aren’t sure they can trust Owen but Nikita stands by her friend.', '2012-11-09', 42, 8.7, 10, '/aEY150Si36aMsKdcO8Y1wJbxKzz.jpg', None, 'fd8471fe06d849b88c677ba86eac7828', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/sHjUSN1R3rF0BVqG9qMhmCE3WuS.jpg', None, 'c8d27e96157a4a808cf1c43b88ffed7c', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771035, 19, 'Self-Destruct', 'Shattered by Amanda’s programming, her inability to save everyone, and her ultimate responsibility for the tragic events at Division, Alex reverts to ... (235 characters truncated) ... he President realizes the sinking depth of the damage. Memories of Division’s glory days haunt them. Birkhoff struggles with his own personal losses.', '2013-04-26', 42, 8.4, 11, '/oKKiyZUTwECxHBOszXqnoSYganS.jpg', None, 'c2ad6b9ce292463581a4012dfd1b32c6', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771031, 20, 'High-Value Target', \"Seized from the wreckage of Division, the black box falls into the hands of a mutinous agent guided by Amanda. Select leaks to sweeten the box's sale ... (216 characters truncated) ...  his help, Nikita, Michael and Alex stage a daring op at the tightly-secured G-20 economic summit to regain control of the box and everyone's future.\", '2013-05-03', 42, 8.7, 10, '/oXzG0eZ2WGPAW3DlV6ZoD72BHtI.jpg', None, '76a9a177491c4e5ab47d2341b566e750', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771033, 21, 'Invisible Hand', 'Before becoming engaged, Nikita said, \"There\\'s always gonna be another mission.\" Now, after barely surviving harrowing recent events, Michael questi ... (269 characters truncated) ... w partners that furnish her with a terrifying new weapon. Meanwhile, Alex considers an intriguing offer from the Nobel Prize winner she\\'s defending.', '2013-05-10', 42, 8.6, 10, '/xUv66IsI2rwBzGHawFYuCxxWMVh.jpg', None, 'dd407f8c449d4fbcb9e4c4df801cdce2', 'cf2a6576e24a40bcb354ffc818f93b17', 771030, 22, 'Til Death Do Us Part', 'Amanda forces Nikita into a life-threatening situation where she has to choose between saving Michael or saving herself. The team races to find a way to stop Amanda, but with a diminished Division, they might finally be out-gunned.', '2013-05-17', 42, 8.8, 11, '/dlW8uEqiapHBqHVyQ3mKnW5vxHq.jpg', None)"}
