{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:46.125619+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 102.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('9c4b96aaee0a440ca6857895f053e464', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771059, 1, 'Wanted', 'Nikita is still on the run after she was framed for the assassination of the President of the United States. Dale, a reporter from the news channel E ... (360 characters truncated) ...  Alex stakes out a human-trafficking ring and learns The Shop is involved. Things go south and Alex is surprised when Owen/Sam shows up at the scene.', '2013-11-21', 42, 9.1, 8, '/r2rmimLg4Z7eKyBHMpejDc0N3bu.jpg', None, '052c8b7f09b84859b8fc9cf06bc4eb2e', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771060, 2, 'Dead or Alive', 'Nikita reunites with Michael, Birkhoff and Ryan aboard the team’s aircraft command center. Michael refuses to discuss their relationship but tells Ni ... (287 characters truncated) ... holds Sam at gunpoint and demands he return what he stole from her, but when a gang of thugs attacks them they are forced to work together to escape.', '2013-11-28', 42, 8.8, 8, '/krndpkA4DoACwBlBjEIFwdRjLnU.jpg', None, 'dc691e3c90a44526b259d6ef39165ed9', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771061, 3, 'Set-Up', \"Tensions continue to escalate between the United States and Pakistan after Amanda plants evidence that Pakistan hired Nikita to kill the President. R ... (113 characters truncated) ...  may have kidnapped Birkhoff and planted a double on the plane. Meanwhile, the CIA captures Alex and questions her about her involvement with Nikita.\", '2013-12-06', 42, 9.0, 8, '/4H3EEQuZaa8OjfjHq0pTjr1JtQm.jpg', None, 'e42c13bf23f243119821f6917c7f8fe3', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771062, 4, 'Pay-Off', 'Jones benches Amanda and takes back the reigns of the operation. He calls Nikita and offers her and the entire team complete freedom by wiping away t ... (380 characters truncated) ... s and contemplates stealing the diamonds. Meanwhile, Michael comes face-to-face with an old adversary, Ramon, who hits Michael with some hard truths.', '2013-12-13', 42, 9.2, 8, '/2jQNSqZ6Oxokz43HbUvlv9bAkw8.jpg', None, '0141e80008a54e8eb92c0c8a7706b164', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771063, 5, 'Bubble', 'Just as Nikita is finally starting to see an end to the long war with The Shop, Ryan confesses a secret that could unravel it all. Meanwhile, Michael ... (302 characters truncated) ... doesn’t take off with the jewels. However, things get messy when Sam is jumped by the loan shark he owes money to, and Alex must step in to save him.', '2013-12-20', 42, 9.0, 8, '/s9WV2Kl8Aa7crLLMFikJ0FkGiPf.jpg', None, 'ab968073d93444d8bb5c2fe3c44ae031', 'fe427bb7c0f9480da8154204d63edd23', 771064, 6, 'Canceled', \"Frustrated that MDK is still active, Nikita decides to end it her way. Leaving Michael and the team behind, Nikita takes Alex on the road to exact re ... (246 characters truncated) ...  to surrender before the military opens fire and kills her. However, Nikita isn't one to give up on a fight, leading her to make a shocking decision.\", '2013-12-27', 42, 9.1, 8, '/cAw4SjzWAvz9UDBuNeDch8NiY7K.jpg', None)"}
