{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:47.564028+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 103.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3da95bf831cc48dabeb11b1387fadffc', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 915551, 1, 'Pilot', \"When tightly wound Capt. Holt takes over the precinct, carefree Det. Jake Peralta and his dysfunctional coworkers' lives get demanding.\", '2013-09-17', 23, 7.8, 86, '/zBDTEJf7TiqaMI2VdQQSelJ67GA.jpg', None, '414ad992da50416c9421899f5025cedd', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 915553, 2, 'The Tagger', 'Jake is assigned a lowly graffiti case as punishment for being late to roll call.', '2013-09-24', 21, 7.5, 72, '/j7L0GDSXWmKaZ1nlxEOoA3m7z7p.jpg', None, 'a982235d4a594ee38ea263d933a348b0', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 915554, 3, 'The Slump', \"Jake's unsolved cases pile up and the other detectives fear that his losing streak will rub off on them, while Amy must run an at-risk youth program.\", '2013-10-01', 22, 7.7, 70, '/o2K9lcwhcvWc0kQDzgXzNXINVU9.jpg', None, '25395890d9de445eafc56206649409c3', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 915552, 4, 'M.E. Time', 'The team turns on Jake for delaying an autopsy report by flirting with an attractive medical examiner, who turns out to be more than he bargained for.', '2013-10-08', 22, 7.7, 57, '/9dozcGhSyLHMVp8pFUA45UwVIjN.jpg', None, 'a19768e04bd84780a34ab73f849b9bed', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/w3aZDxuc6dqnrjiW6Qp1iGw0MYU.jpg', None, 'dfe04f95e80d4e8b8c0661c696456ac6', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 972341, 19, 'Tactical Village', 'At Tactical Village, where the precinct competes against other precincts in paintball exercises, Jake gets jealous when Amy runs into an old flame.', '2014-03-04', 22, 8.0, 51, '/lVdgq7eDrhInMUWFf4phzjjl81X.jpg', None, '3c68bb6ff538442b9e1597aff8d84886', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 972691, 20, 'Fancy Brudgom', \"When Charles makes Jake his best man, it means cake tasting, choosing flowers and convincing fiancée Vivian that Charles doesn't want to move.\", '2014-03-11', 21, 7.7, 48, '/fahSrCxAYyqGQEmbA9LxxFksasr.jpg', None, '7753649c9f2e4b0a8452ec1928d5fb3f', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 973086, 21, 'Unsolvable', 'On a solving streak, Jake decides to spend his weekend off with Sgt. Terry trying to crack a cold case that no one thinks can be solved.', '2014-03-18', 22, 7.9, 51, '/fRomiUiWrHqyPbBnKL7pdICbvHM.jpg', None, '8d8c409858ec488f846b443d46159bb4', 'f4a02540bec549a98e42289e16bb08b7', 973302, 22, 'Charges and Specs', 'Jake risks suspension when the commissioner shuts down his investigation of a civic leader and he gets Amy and Holt to help him work the case anyway.', '2014-03-25', 22, 8.3, 51, '/1TadanH1OC01jOnw4fNSX3SOMEJ.jpg', None)"}
