{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:47.762755+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 104.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('af0d1d8e0f1741638628707eec7ea028', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1004769, 1, 'Undercover', 'When Jake discovers that a mobster escaped his otherwise successful sting, he enlists Charles to help track him down, which worries Gina.', '2014-09-28', 22, 7.7, 58, '/buRG5yhoiYHO6Zmj7GRwnkS7aUR.jpg', None, 'c4235760bb804800b3554fa1d2ae377c', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1004770, 2, 'Chocolate Milk', \"Holt's nemesis heads the precinct inspection, while Terry readies for his vasectomy and Charles needs a date for his ex-wife's engagement party.\", '2014-10-05', 22, 7.6, 55, '/euoqYEnIcfTqE0ZLyCbxju8sDcQ.jpg', None, 'a3ec5d376f2b41eebc88f7bc4cac3221', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1009811, 3, 'The Jimmy Jab Games', 'When a motorcade detail is delayed, it leads to a wacky competition, and Charles must get an incriminating videotape from Hitchcock.', '2014-10-12', 22, 7.9, 55, '/pVefAbDUUkQkvYtricssfFxL9YS.jpg', None, '24def09d3a1649cc9183e07a8f785b44', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1010284, 4, 'Halloween II', 'For their annual Halloween wager, Jake bets Holt that he can steal his watch before midnight, and Gina gets kicked off her dance squad, Floorgasm.', '2014-10-19', 22, 8.1, 57, '/5FFSvBcbScc4LWTI72VG7gwQH3K.jpg', None, 'fda9c4c5857744f09741a285d17a91f8', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707' ... 176 parameters truncated ... '/62VLTLhb3p7qDJES5hvi8YfHYnw.jpg', None, '535cae5524a9441480cbfd3d6febf24f', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1050494, 20, 'AC/DC', \"Terry forces Jake to take time off after he's injured chasing a perp, and Holt and Rosa go on an awkward double date with their significant others.\", '2015-04-26', 22, 7.9, 40, '/58jvUMGqiZGLBNXp22uNJgqIBxZ.jpg', None, '2ca18ad5af3b4381a7295ac4d0ffff62', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1052898, 21, 'Det. Dave Majors', \"Jake gets jealous over another detective's romantic interest in Amy, and Terry is tempted to accept a job at a private security firm.\", '2015-05-03', 22, 7.8, 40, '/bEALUmShCajBgwsByPIGOhJKLs3.jpg', None, '57d7697e53bd4c8c9bba865e36d706f0', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1053440, 22, 'The Chopper', 'Holt worries Jake is being set up to fail when Wuntch green lights his dream assignment, and Terry hosts a field trip for a magnet school.', '2015-05-10', 22, 8.2, 39, '/kUSC8LDE1b4fl4vbamrpaoge1JH.jpg', None, '3ef3152ff069425eba1a4e2b110c6108', '3b1c2c8eeffb4078b5b94ea0edcdd707', 1054900, 23, 'Johnny and Dora', 'Jake and Amy go undercover to catch an infamous identity thief, and the squad is rocked by an unexpected farewell.', '2015-05-17', 22, 8.5, 42, '/yB8DpaWxoii9x6I9VDjc7dXLUCV.jpg', None)"}
