t who targeted Pimento, the team stages an elaborate fake funeral and sends Amy on a risky undercover mission.', '2016-04-05', 22, 7.6, 45, '/qLhhKFC13BzTSKf0EZzuOFLunO6.jpg', None, '20a9874a073d474692106dc6896f1c7a', 'e4e371af60ba43a48055775e26587091', 1181841, 22, 'Bureau', \"With help from an old friend of Holt's, the gang sneaks into the FBI to find dirt on the double agent. An inmate puts Charles in an awkward position.\", '2016-04-12', 22, 7.9, 45, '/zSgQ567YDisEMAVr1gGxn3VrDcS.jpg', None, 'f461dad9c5184dc7ac743d50239f8402', 'e4e371af60ba43a48055775e26587091', 1181842, 23, 'Greg and Larry', 'Jake and the team scour the hospital for a captive Captain Holt, while Amy and Charles book it back to New York to help their friends.', '2016-04-19', 22, 8.3, 36, '/e2i1S0r8Jlv4LCUiE9NNijRXU7C.jpg', None)"}
