{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:48.264015+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 104.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f53a73b51ce9424ebdae429a9d9b94a6', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1206222, 1, 'Coral Palms (1)', 'Jake and Holt continue their new lives in Florida under the Witness Protection Program while Jimmy remains at large, but their identities may be revealed after a video of the pair goes viral.', '2016-09-20', 22, 7.8, 46, '/zd3836SivFA8Ivo1KjS3w7cX9zo.jpg', None, '932c8f946f4542079a965241f2bc0c81', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1223128, 2, 'Coral Palms (2)', 'Jake and Holt end up on the other side of the interrogation table after being caught plotting an attack on Figgis. Meanwhile, a questionable new captain takes over at the precinct.', '2016-09-27', 22, 7.9, 46, '/n1IXOoCAa69MUFexYoctXqTGPYX.jpg', None, 'aa874887be36413485a3b293b4ac9d66', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1223833, 3, 'Coral Palms (3)', 'The team makes a road trip to Florida to try to help Jake and Holt take down Figgis. With an unforeseen injury and yet another interruption by Sheriff Reynolds, the plan doesn’t follow through quite like they all had hoped. In the midst of the chaos, Jake and Amy share an awkward reunion.', '2016-10-04', 21, 8.0, 39, '/8JFP0YSse4af7r44i6ZtcMqyrG6.jpg', None, 'ba9e5b18bbda439fbdd8cb5dd805945c', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1225523, 4, 'The Night Shift (I)', 'As Jake struggles with his first case back at the precinct, he encounters Jess Day, who is visiting New York, and enlists her to help him find his su ... (46 characters truncated) ... ease office morale and Amy tries to figure out why Rosa keeps taking such long breaks.\\n\\nThe crossover continues on New Girl S06E04 Homecoming (II).', '2016-10-11', 22, 7.3, 46, '/vcYuPywIzaTrfzqaIfc9YdZ8qqt.jpg', None, 'a1786f362d9d490abf2f984e39986250', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/hca1Vfv1MH16wKsjpITGRThD4hQ.jpg', None, '16495ab088fb4053887edfe9c605f5c5', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1309428, 19, 'Your Honor', \"While looking into a break-in at Holt's mother's house, Jake discovers a secret she’s been keeping from her son. The squad remodels the break room.\", '2017-05-16', 22, 7.6, 40, '/tA0fIngOsosJCrJxvLjbT32v0MG.jpg', None, '3e432a41b97c44cfaaed4011e5c64e82', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1309429, 20, 'The Slaughterhouse', 'A drug case leads Jake and Rosa to an investigation conducted by their shared idol, Lt. Hawkins, who indicates she may have a job for one of them.', '2017-05-16', 21, 7.7, 41, '/6o2vrtxai5fLTXQTkXUB022eSD0.jpg', None, '8ed55840e97e4203a11bc4f836b9adbe', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1313832, 21, 'The Bank Job', \"Jake and Rosa call for backup from Holt and Pimento after their search for bank robbers turns dangerous. Boyle disapproves of Gina's new boyfriend.\", '2017-05-23', 22, 8.0, 36, '/mIR5QkvLhGsJbjtaZUdvQZvaCb4.jpg', None, 'f03e2b4ec27448ab834e324f851e70c7', '6ec4f3f790f14994adb56fa16f796ae1', 1313833, 22, 'Crime & Punishment', \"When Jake and Rosa find themselves framed for a crime they didn't commit, the squad must cook up an exceptionally creative solution.\", '2017-05-23', 22, 8.1, 37, '/gsERiyMMxSZoj15QO9L0dKOv1Bg.jpg', None)"}
