{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:48.458472+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 104.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('511dc2adc26f4ef6806af4b671f682fb', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1353983, 1, 'The Big House (1)', 'Stuck behind bars, Jake lands in trouble over some delicious contraband. Fellow inmate Rosa keeps Holt and Terry busy with a never-ending to-do list.', '2017-09-26', 22, 8.1, 46, '/recKzFehIDBHSOs7H1xM6rVLY33.jpg', None, '9e5e8c5fcd6e41e78405933d2c5dfa6e', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1368191, 2, 'The Big House (2)', 'As the squad looks for ways to implicate the corrupt Lt. Hawkins, Jake puts his detective skills to work with help from his affable cannibal cellmate.', '2017-10-03', 22, 8.0, 44, '/1njsQYVm7R4j8yKRumAUBXwsQWe.jpg', None, '009aa15282074e37a422e8dcc8fb9030', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1371839, 3, 'Kicks', \"Freed from prison and back on duty, Jake hunts for a sneaker thief under Holt's watchful eye. Meanwhile, Rosa suspects Pimento of infidelity.\", '2017-10-10', 22, 7.5, 42, '/nKLyiYT3t3w4EWvX1HekcmaUIR6.jpg', None, '84be86c88ff842e694058ffa954c2348', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1374428, 4, 'HalloVeen', \"Jake pulls off a major surprise during the squad's annual Halloween heist, a cutthroat competition to claim the coveted title of Amazing Human/Genius.\", '2017-10-17', 22, 8.7, 44, '/7rnE9Ul7CwVymc3XTaAxfGtlljn.jpg', None, '803cba2525584c01a36b4e8766d52db3', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/cSmxMrKcX6mHRzYrbVToZTWaDma.jpg', None, '21031ea0416d4185a5659f3183b41407', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1462494, 19, 'Bachelor/ette Party', 'Charles\\'s convoluted bachelor party plans frustrate Jake, Terry and Holt. At her bachelorette bash, Amy plays a revealing game of \"Never Have I Ever.\"', '2018-04-29', 22, 7.7, 40, '/4Y0DchWTAkNRhKyqqXT8h6gsJ8q.jpg', None, 'e215290ef5c34bbcaa67a9ba1b5112d5', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1469581, 20, 'Show Me Going', 'An anxious Nine-Nine awaits news on Rosa after she enters an active shooter situation. Amy and Gina distract themselves by taking on a plumbing issue.', '2018-05-06', 22, 7.7, 38, '/g6SoyhSnEcMhzCqX2omAgSNf5tS.jpg', None, '7d776100f2d64ddc8882f3f19bfc0455', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1473136, 21, 'White Whale', 'As Rosa and Amy hunt a criminal who escaped their clutches years ago, Jake takes over wedding prep. Holt faces off with his rival for commissioner.', '2018-05-13', 22, 7.7, 40, '/yijgYRLCgo8xunDWU7KhlSDt40u.jpg', None, '54c5c88777c74f8488c1c23e28cdcae5', '9da6cf5d48274560be52f1f25f170d88', 1477935, 22, 'Jake & Amy', 'When Jake and Amy suffer a wedding day crisis, the Nine-Nine attempts to salvage the nuptials. Holt receives news on his bid for the commissioner job.', '2018-05-20', 22, 8.3, 40, '/nbveKNVqHZdPu5DR6rEMAzhY6mD.jpg', None)"}
