{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:48.610708+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 105s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('953cc59be1fe4451afb99699cfb64bee', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1645240, 1, 'Honeymoon', \"An unexpected third wheel puts a damper on Jake and Amy's tropical honeymoon. Back at the Nine-Nine, Terry experiences a crisis of confidence.\", '2019-01-10', 22, 7.815, 46, '/bLZSOzRAqO5V74D2koPksQscC3t.jpg', None, 'edec59d62bad4b27a745d1d944cabaea', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1645241, 2, 'Hitchcock & Scully', \"Jake and Charles investigate a case of Hitchcock and Scully's from the 1980s. Meanwhile, Amy's uniformed officers and Terry's detectives fight over limited resources.\", '2019-01-17', 22, 8.1, 44, '/sfWFDgNUDjDBo9HOgNG4tSIAk7d.jpg', None, 'e1d9bb257cac4fa0be2d7cf8c210ac90', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1664108, 3, 'The Tattler', 'Jake and Gina attend their 20th high school reunion. Back at the Nine-Nine, Charles helps Rosa with her love life.', '2019-01-24', 22, 7.2, 44, '/l1NZcemvW2husp07poXhHxABhmt.jpg', None, '35541b3e188a4c5ebf35bd20f53d7413', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1677231, 4, 'Four Movements', 'After Gina makes a life-changing decision, she bestows a series of gifts on the squad. But first, an interpretive dance ...', '2019-01-31', 22, 6.9, 45, '/dGbTIbYP315IkTJ20UoNeiH1IH5.jpg', None, '0bec99e1314e47d7998a0c78432af2b9', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982' ... 116 parameters truncated ... '/xnv8adqyfG70DQEnp9ugLHs16mp.jpg', None, '44a82780d0334bbeac6afe3c8f24bfc8', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1762637, 15, 'Return of the King', \"Gina invites Jake and Terry over to her new place. Holt takes an interest in Nikolaj's education. Rosa rejects Amy's offer of a helping hand.\", '2019-05-02', 22, 6.8, 36, '/o4LiSkg9Izbero76SwZpon1PZ1w.jpg', None, 'a9ab7d615d4a40d7a11e13aed9bd6436', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1782130, 16, 'Cinco de Mayo', \"Mayhem and double-crossing overtake the squad as they try to distract Terry from his lieutenant's exam by kicking off the Halloween Heist on a new day.\", '2019-05-09', 22, 8.4, 41, '/7V16fperXSPfFyoYVC3e2YmxCkZ.jpg', None, '9a342c6e27df4d6db39bef6400eac990', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1782131, 17, 'Sicko (1)', 'Jake and Boyle hunt for a serial killer under the watchful eye of Commissioner Kelly. Terry learns that more money does indeed bring more problems.', '2019-05-16', 22, 7.8, 38, '/ub4PLlJv2KGXETOQrq5JVjqKDYs.jpg', None, '4d33114af55d492e9f19b4777c9d5bb1', '994cf0d328c0487dae65bd8ac643c982', 1782132, 18, 'Suicide Squad (2)', 'To right a wrong, the Nine-Nine teams up with the worst of the worst of the NYPD. Terry sinks into deep denial about his future.', '2019-05-16', 22, 8.1, 40, '/yMu84cLYRJdfnUUxA2XF1GB45uO.jpg', None)"}
