{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:49.839204+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 2739 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:49.839368+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 106.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ca9bbd44e1c7400ca0cd1bfbd798404a', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 4325044, 1, 'Starlight: WISH', 'You’re not crime-fighting ready, until you’re camera ready. To get the deepest clean for the most sensitive skin, try the new oil-free skincare line from the freshest face among The Seven: Wish by Starlight. A Vought International Company.', '2019-05-01', 1, 10.0, 1, '/aX3nE9aUIljNhCSCkHZBGBbJ0H3.jpg', None, '8b42c7e3f9be46a5b831591de140c339', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 4325045, 2, 'Newsstand', 'Everyone loves superheroes. They swoop out of the sky and save the day. This city’s in thrall to them: we buy their toys, watch their movies, read th ... (99 characters truncated) ...  where Butcher comes in. He’s here to spank those supes when they get out of line. And he won’t rest until he’s done with each and every one of them.', '2019-06-05', 1, 10.0, 1, '/yO3kRy31ms0Fn4KsIL3ZxTR8NbN.jpg', None, '8de62369217f4ca89e7be53064efdd38', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 4325043, 3, 'Show Me the Doll', 'Hello boys and girls. This is Mr. Butcher and he’s here today to teach you all about supes. Because supes, you see, ain’t always nice. Sometimes they are very, very not nice. So grab your dollies and sit down criss-cross-applesauce: story time is about to start.', '2019-08-02', 1, 9.0, 2, '/wZxtfOWg3cZbl8lsYuAFgkshptk.jpg', None, '766dfdbd117b4808a29cbb3a61d43aa3', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 2431460, 4, 'Butcher: A Short Film', 'Butcher relives the past, recalling violence and betrayal on the rough road towards finding his wife Becca.', '2020-09-10', 5, 6.4, 9, '/rWlnk1kYlHtjg75diQLrnY7P9t1.jpg', None, 'dbbf46818357405c9664d67c5672bcf1', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7' ... 812 parameters truncated ... '/mgOAvVzedK2fnf6rYQABcE1L3l5.jpg', None, 'b8232d29919d4aa486b1d00c7f294905', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 7280937, 73, 'Ashley Barrett - Liquid Death Partnership', 'Today, we are proud to help introduce a new spokesperson for @liquiddeath – Ashley Barrett. Just like Homelander, she cares deeply about what America ... (63 characters truncated) ... elf to an easy drinking sparkling energy – guaranteed to not explode your head! (NOTE: President Barrett was still Vice President at time of filming)', '2026-05-15', 2, 0.0, 0, '/zwO6lyfgp4c9W9m9qscRkxh8XHv.jpg', None, 'efd1c4e79ed74ce29b032ec1cd059fa1', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 7331031, 74, 'The Deep - In Memorium', 'Bro down, patriots. The Deep heroically gave his life saving his beloved marine animals from the Vought Pipeline, which to be clear, was a product of the corrupt Homelander administration.  Dolphins and octopi everywhere are in mourning, and the Manhandled Podcast is on pause until further notice.', '2026-05-29', 2, 0.0, 0, '/7TEcZ7m4eMakAwNfZBe16HIu1rd.jpg', None, '3ca8dd23bc0347ad89348a7101b3dad9', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 7337444, 75, 'Oh Father - In Memorium', 'On the Lord’s Day, we take a moment to remember Oh Father, who was brutally murdered by Homelander in his recent reign of terror. He was a spiritual leader unlike any other, and his voice will never be gagged. Rest in power, Oh Father!', '2026-05-30', 1, 0.0, 0, '/4paAXkl2gkmwG90OPXtXEfOcYt1.jpg', None, '1607f348d3894bebb1199faede418820', '02dd87547a2645e9bb7abec6b5d37db7', 7387115, 76, \"Black Noir's New Mission\", 'We’ve seen your questions on Black Noir’s whereabouts, and can assure you he has merely departed on yet another critical mission overseas. If he coul ... (12 characters truncated) ... would tell you reports of his demise are greatly exaggerated. Thank you for your service, Noir, and for being the best bro this nation could ask for!', '2026-06-14', 1, 0.0, 0, '/1d6pMYljv3tVlNka48z3YMIHG8b.jpg', None)"}
