{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:49.978543+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 106.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('464698dbc3514331ac5620ea946c27f4', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1705013, 1, 'The Name of the Game', 'When a Supe kills the love of his life, A/V salesman Hughie Campbell teams up with Billy Butcher, a vigilante hell-bent on punishing corrupt Supes — and Hughie’s life will never be the same again.', '2019-07-25', 62, 8.207, 258, '/goKrbjePcjv6eJ7covjw0MPT62V.jpg', None, 'f400f9d9b40f4026800030819bd6b39e', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863436, 2, 'Cherry', 'The Boys get themselves a Superhero, Starlight gets payback, Homelander gets naughty, and a Senator gets naughtier.', '2019-07-25', 59, 8.192, 203, '/nNfmRSQp42V6AS5bO1S7LMv2QOd.jpg', None, 'ef901b6e75f74b3ba2139eb933d441e0', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863437, 3, 'Get Some', 'It’s the race of the century. A-Train versus Shockwave, vying for the title of World’s Fastest Man. Meanwhile, the Boys are reunited and it feels so good.', '2019-07-25', 55, 8.089, 196, '/mF7TK7LMbWhlLz1Q5M1662TiKvP.jpg', None, 'c9256922e72640468efb12ef0f6765df', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863438, 4, 'The Female of the Species', 'On a very special episode of The Boys… an hour of guts, gutterballs, airplane hijackings, madness, ghosts, and one very intriguing Female. Oh, and lots of heart — both in the sentimental sense, and in the gory literal sense.', '2019-07-25', 56, 8.191, 186, '/1JvhnZyeQkIUrhr0OUL6S3sN5Kt.jpg', None, 'd0a4eca2c406483fb88501eec6b900b1', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863439, 5, 'Good for the Soul', 'The Boys head to the “Believe” Expo to follow a promising lead in their ongoing war against the Supes. There might — MIGHT — be a homicidal infant, but you’ll have to see for yourself.', '2019-07-25', 60, 7.963, 190, '/8eimUVjdXKtVb4OMzQn3aj3I0XN.jpg', None, '61e167899e5247148815084cbebd3323', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863440, 6, 'The Innocents', 'SUPER IN AMERICA (2019). Vought Studios. Genre: Reality. Starring: Homelander, Queen Maeve, Black Noir, The Deep, A-Train, Starlight, Tara Reid, Billy Zane.', '2019-07-25', 60, 7.874, 178, '/vWZAUXUszcg4EdmptxCk0ycKOMI.jpg', None, '5e8ea79df5924654a2565fdacfe206ac', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863441, 7, 'The Self-Preservation Society', 'Never trust a washed-up Supe — the Boys learn this lesson the hard way. Meanwhile, Homelander digs into his past, Starlight discovers that love hurts, and if you’re ever in Sandusky, Ohio and a girl asks if she can touch your gills, say NO.', '2019-07-25', 56, 8.352, 179, '/cx7dCZVzCX9pAyC6zE6lC6jkuyF.jpg', None, 'c38834c8ec6342e38931f3806bfba2a8', '4b54d2abb3764ca683e72f318106255e', 1863442, 8, 'You Found Me', 'Season Finale Time! Questions answered! Secrets revealed! Conflicts… conflicted! Characters exploded! And so much more!', '2019-07-25', 66, 8.413, 183, '/gGNAbWmON1zOa2mZcBdu9gYrDCg.jpg', None)"}
