{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:50.112379+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 106.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d75c3f9d5d4c430da9cf63cbf38e92e3', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324358, 1, 'The Big Ride', 'Season 2! New and improved! Now with 50% more explosive decapitations, terrorists, S&M hookers, cults, and a new pine fresh scent! But wait, there’s  ... (2 characters truncated) ... re! 2X MORE blood, guts and gore than the other leading brands! This exclusive offer is available only on Amazon Prime Video! Don’t delay! Order now!', '2020-09-03', 63, 7.836, 168, '/3N5CZhL6jXbuSA3qS7G46PiAZND.jpg', None, '4945e5c86f67415f9cdf5789873ee11d', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324558, 2, 'Proper Preparation and Planning', 'The Boys get themselves a Super Terrorist, Starlight gets evidence against Vought, The Deep gets in touch with his feelings, and Homelander gets himself a family (sort of).  All that, and a hard-hitting exposé on why Super Suits don’t have pockets.', '2020-09-03', 59, 7.564, 156, '/m6LSiAimRiST07sC0vsUDITojT3.jpg', None, '7f6f4e8a846d4c009fe8874ccc6eb4f1', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324560, 3, 'Over the Hill with the Swords of a Thousand Men', 'Attention: If you or a loved one were exposed to Compound V, you may be entitled to financial compensation. Vought has given the drug to multiple vic ... (67 characters truncated) ... r a loved one were administered Compound V, call the law firm of Bremmer & Bremmer at 1-888-177-2774 for a free legal consultation. Know your rights!', '2020-09-03', 61, 8.45, 159, '/theLFUijxwD0uzdiNiJVzOpCVSG.jpg', None, '59e64ded02f54217a60b0b6fa73922ac', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324556, 4, 'Nothing Like It in the World', 'Road trip! The Boys head to North Carolina to follow a lead on a mysterious Supe named Liberty. And did you know a person’s choice of candy bars might tell you if they’re a serial killer? Watch and learn the warning signs! This episode could save your life!', '2020-09-10', 70, 7.689, 156, '/6cAdAEomp2I0JwSYNcobAB1NIdm.jpg', None, '0cda60879a184aeeb7654ac0a6310e2a', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324561, 5, 'We Gotta Go Now', 'VoughtStudios is pleased to announce that filming has begun on #DawnOfTheSeven. 12 years of VCU movies have led to this. If you like movies about One Hero, you’ll love a movie about Seven Heroes. Introducing newest member @RealStormfront! See how the legend began! In theaters Summer 2021!', '2020-09-17', 63, 7.977, 149, '/pn5adU2bTuMvBUZoEx2qDmSS8dv.jpg', None, 'a9b3b577f66943329d81dd5a874872ef', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324565, 6, 'The Bloody Doors Off', 'The Sage Grove Center® is dedicated to caring for those struggling with mental illness. Our compassionate doctors and counselors provide personalized ... (87 characters truncated) ...  the Sage Grove Center today at 1-800-122-8585. A proud subsidiary of Global Wellness Services®, which is a proud subsidiary of Vought International®', '2020-09-24', 66, 8.298, 146, '/ApfUQLbraTvHT1ZQ5qSafKkJC9Z.jpg', None, '4b71b48202a24bb39d08c78f1741acb3', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324563, 7, 'Butcher, Baker, Candlestick Maker', 'Congresswoman Victoria Neuman’s sham Congressional Hearing against Vought takes place in 3 DAYS. Are we going to let her criminalize Superheroes when ... (91 characters truncated) ...  fellow Patriotic Americans and send $20 to VOUGHTPROMISE.COM to tell Neuman and her Kangaroo Court Cronies that they won’t win, “Not On Our Watch”™.', '2020-10-01', 56, 8.307, 148, '/z2npefs7R96VwfgvhGWoPYpdLFj.jpg', None, '03836f0e4757453ebbf2129c1328f554', '6c8a46002d7a4d8eae14fd01d961bda5', 2324567, 8, 'What I Know', '***SUPER VILLAIN ALERT*** YOU ARE RECEIVING THIS NOTIFICATION FROM THE DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND SECURITY. A SUPER VILLAIN ALERT HAS BEEN ISSUED FOR YOU ... (52 characters truncated) ...  PERSONS OR ACTIVITY. IF YOU BELIEVE YOU HAVE SEEN A SUPER VILLAIN, DO NOT APPROACH OR ATTEMPT TO APPREHEND THEM. CONTACT LAW ENFORCEMENT IMMEDIATELY', '2020-10-08', 70, 8.581, 167, '/ur98U8EhoxcGD2dpnpP4dCk9W09.jpg', None)"}
