{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:50.900745+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 107.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('700092f2efd644c0bbd9fe521b01dc23', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140221, 1, 'Hug Me, Brother (Pilot)', \"When Drake uses Josh's secret advice column to impress the hottest girl in school, a case of mistaken identity results in Josh coming face-to-face with a jealous boyfriend.\", '2004-01-11', 24, 7.8, 5, '/20dphoYQ2djFzqOlrlEOehKrZtv.jpg', None, '97867bb133f54bbd800d59d92a95fb0b', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140225, 2, 'Dune Buggy', 'Drake and Josh receive an old dune buggy from a friend but are forbidden to use it. When Drake defies his parents and injures himself after crashing the buggy, he tries to hide his injuries, but gets no support from a grounded Josh.', '2004-01-18', 24, 8.4, 5, '/f6AYbLIQ6rpSirLPyYWTnwlhEyO.jpg', None, 'c2b8ea941121481385a476713d62e295', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140229, 3, 'Believe Me, Brother', \"Josh thinks Drake's flirtatious new girlfriend is interested in him too and sets up a sting operation to find out the truth.\", '2004-01-25', 24, 4.8, 5, '/aA82oPbxL9PhJ4yXNmNfRnA8Lan.jpg', None, 'af5684f35ce34688a3582bb3e5ab633d', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140227, 4, 'Two Idiots and a Baby', \"When Mr. Nichols's boss calls off their dinner plans because of a last minute babysitter cancellation, Josh volunteers his and Drake's services.\", '2004-02-08', 24, 8.5, 4, '/aunSWZraeDCGWaPfMx5WqCZuljG.jpg', None, '4ff229415a884a63bcdbfe019fccb01a', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140230, 5, 'First Crush', \"After Drake agrees to help Josh with his girl troubles, Josh finds himself promising to play a birthday song at his crush's party.\", '2004-02-15', 24, 7.3, 3, '/txrSmN00YxDHUp4w9ZwXJuxjwRz.jpg', None, '8501de02a5f84e4caa0e4bba7feca882', '8236007b2aad48b0b253e3a062a18a7e', 140231, 6, 'Grammy', \"When the parents leave town for the weekend, Drake and Josh's excitement is short lived when they learn that Grammy is coming to stay.\", '2004-02-22', 24, 7.8, 4, '/cyvRJBk3cjmDeR81gHqrC8f6UJo.jpg', None)"}
