{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:51.039701+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 107.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b1db342a09c2408ab73500993ed6fc4a', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140232, 1, 'The Bet', \"Drake and Josh make a bet to swear off junk food (Drake) and Video Games (Josh). Megan makes both of them swear to dye their hair pink (whoever loses ... (40 characters truncated) ... cover them making a bet, they make a bet as well. When things get crazy, Drake and Josh can't hold onto their bet much longer and decide to break it.\", '2004-03-14', 27, 8.3, 3, '/k0boZJEojBfr0hI8X5YFtYuPj9Q.jpg', None, '8e5ea1512b93489cbb47ca6ddd78de7a', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140233, 2, 'Guitar', 'Drake is so excited when Megan wins a radio contest, and the prize is tickets to the Zero Gravity concert and a guitar signed by Devan Malone, the he ... (231 characters truncated) ... nsane forever. Meanwhile, Walter tries to spend quality time with Drake, but everytime Walter tries to go for it, Drake is doing something important.', '2004-03-21', 27, 7.7, 3, '/8Q19LUpNTBWzpM2AkzQu8EE5qnL.jpg', None, '7d2217e65e714740865b95cf4c1e377d', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140236, 3, 'Movie Job', \"Josh and Drake both get a job at the movie theater. Josh does a bunch of work, but Drake slacks off and gets all the credit. When Drake becomes Josh's boss, Josh is fed up, because he was doing all of Drake's work for him.\", '2004-03-28', 27, 7.3, 3, '/9ptULmVEzPaw51DWvyvVn0YofuO.jpg', None, 'cc84f13e732b4aa184b04695d7a1e16b', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140238, 4, 'Football', 'Drake tries to make Josh cool by telling him to try out for the football team. Instead, Josh gets \"murdered\" and he ends up being equipment manager,  ... (56 characters truncated) ... s sick by Josh\\'s brownies, the coach depends on Josh to play center. So now Drake must help Josh become cool and at the same time not actually play.', '2004-04-04', 27, 7.8, 4, '/kpryaFrPy2RuC64AMf3WcXnGees.jpg', None, 'a15f7099d7824d08b6d8df7f90fc9d99', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032' ... 68 parameters truncated ... '/vbylIbwGpHtBVZGsQuu3WknTLd5.jpg', None, '6458aaab6d344019ad7c6fa662096081', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140247, 11, 'The Mean Teacher', \"Drake has a girlfriend named Kelly who has a laughing problem. He really wants to break up with her, but can't. The reason why is because she is the  ... (38 characters truncated) ...  Hayfer, who threatens him with summer school if he breaks up with her daughter. Meanwhile, Josh gets a very ugly shirt which he claims as good luck.\", '2004-09-26', 27, 7.5, 2, '/wWVEPkatZrveTPVU0ikPgaGB9Ac.jpg', None, 'dfaa6dabcd10417391cf4900bd6ce027', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140248, 12, 'The Gary Grill', \"Drake & Josh are approached by two salesmen who offer them a one-time deal, Gary Grills. Drake and Josh quickly become attached to them and sell them acceptionally. But they don't realize that these Grills come with a price.\", '2004-10-17', 27, 8.0, 4, '/xGz6ki6FPO31XnbFCdrtg7pPV7o.jpg', None, '2201794855224c9c863ef05f9e28263c', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140252, 13, 'Drew & Jerry', 'Drake is getting tired of hanging around with Josh all the time. So Josh finds a friend named Drew who looks just like Drake. Drake feels he is being left out because of Drew, so he finds his own friend named Jerry who looks and acts like Josh.', '2004-10-24', 27, 9.0, 4, '/kRTwy7hijqjBzE1Y1G1OnVcLZ5f.jpg', None, '7af91e123d6a4f669d4dd08e4605ec69', '074d79e8cb9e4ed6948b9e7f58ab5032', 140254, 14, 'Honor Council', \"Drake is accused of parking Mrs. Hafer's car in the middle of her classroom. Drake and Josh must go in front of the school's Honor Council to prove Drake is innocent.\", '2004-11-28', 27, 8.0, 3, '/iLJht2vWYYimOcskMDEnUFTnXcl.jpg', None)"}
