{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:51.191715+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 107.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('39710fa3688840e0884947ba857515fc', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140256, 1, 'The Drake and Josh Inn', \"When Audrey and Walter go out of town for spring break they leave Drake, Josh, and Megan at home by themselves. When they are at the Premiere they ov ... (85 characters truncated) ... ntage of this opportunity and say that their vacant house is a hotel. Meanwhile, Megan is attempting to get Drake and Josh to treat her like a guest.\", '2005-04-02', 27, 7.7, 3, '/xa1rQ9eASO9F8zuFINObGEMp255.jpg', None, '8992db0265034295b2eb4b27c6eeb065', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140271, 2, 'Peruvian Puff Pepper', \"Drake and Josh enter a salsa contest so they can win a 45 inch high depth Yatzubishi plasma screen TV. But they won't let Megan join their team, so s ... (21 characters truncated) ... rty. After she gets the boys in trouble twice and she makes her own salsa, she buys the ultimate target for Drake and Josh. The Peruvian Puff Pepper.\", '2005-04-09', 27, 7.5, 4, '/14uAEm3oCwvFxRe2PHDq6OeP6ct.jpg', None, '167c166e41464ddc82344f27ff093aad', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140258, 3, \"We're Married?\", \"Josh's e-pal, Yooka, is coming from Yudonia to visit Josh. Drake doesn't care about her at first, but then he sees how hot she is. Josh overhears Yooka telling her parents she is homesick, so he arranges what he thinks is a friendship ceremony but is really a marriage ceremony.\", '2005-04-16', 27, 7.7, 3, '/xbWBipT08sZMcBtyNowC99g3vqR.jpg', None, '16d54ccac06443d795f2f02e0c51e153', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140259, 4, \"Mindy's Back\", \"It's the time for the Science Fair. Josh is confident that he'll win first prize, until Mindy Crenshaw returns! Josh comes in second like every year, ... (40 characters truncated) ... art. After the Science Fair, he develops a liking of Mindy who also has a liking of him. Right before they know it, they're boyfriend and girlfriend!\", '2005-04-30', 27, 8.0, 2, '/ebfLMhMol45Da15mrTORwduVlI.jpg', None, '7424a433287b41d489baf2c902d0caf8', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083' ... 104 parameters truncated ... '/wVPzTBf60EGRzF7QcqbzDFOSgpx.jpg', None, 'ee7c46bb855a4805ae46cce4fb3e2368', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140267, 14, 'Theater Thug', 'Josh gets a part on a TV crime show where he plays the infamous \"Theater Thug.\" Following his TV debut he becomes a public enemy as a case of mistaken identity gets out of hand.', '2006-02-18', 27, 7.5, 4, '/z2wPMinbv8fwSTAMaJCtidF1L4K.jpg', None, 'de6d0a905b0243c0ba104ef54053f253', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140268, 15, 'The Demonator', 'A new roller coaster is coming out called, the Demonator. Drake and Josh want to be there the first day it opens. But when they get in line, their wild adventure starts.', '2006-02-25', 27, 7.7, 3, '/3HRL6uTimUX4clOKJG249SpBsZI.jpg', None, '8058eec56b9d46f99b70bda3f7610fac', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140269, 16, 'Alien Invasion', 'Drake and Josh decide to turn the tables and prank little Megan. She actually believes that aliens are coming down to Earth and they are going to kidnap her. But at the end, Drake and Josh find that this may not go as they hoped.', '2006-03-18', 27, 8.0, 2, '/3KCSyPpKvR4M6tXDKjjDexYLQT7.jpg', None, 'f1988e8caa6e4f2da61899b90ccd1778', '4aa825d83f774bb4bd1277fc4a9eb083', 140270, 17, 'Dr. Phyllis Show', 'Drake and Josh go on the Dr. Phyliss Show and relive some of their most outlandish moments. Some will jab at your funny bone, while others will tug on your heart strings.', '2006-04-08', 27, 8.0, 2, '/7utq5XSKoJwr2kvloom7wkJIIUa.jpg', None)"}
