{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:51.360425+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 107.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e5e3d5efe2d747798c23e0922993a839', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140275, 1, 'Josh Runs Into Oprah', 'Josh is jazzed at the prospect of meeting his TV idol when Drake gets tickets to “Oprah” for his birthday, but delight turns to dismay in the studio parking lot.', '2006-09-24', 27, 8.0, 1, '/uPCj907JCl1zI6KfWCdF3tg91xm.jpg', None, 'd31f412224c24c8d8d5479aec824ad87', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140276, 2, 'Vicious Tiberius', \"Mrs. Hayfer needs a house sitter for the weekend and it's the boys to the rescue, but all doesn't go according to plan when they meet Tiberius, a vicious dog with an appetite for… Drake and Josh?! Walter is exercising for the mile run against another weather man.\", '2006-10-01', 27, 8.0, 1, '/ww2qEN8x68n4vBmS6ppzBWnTW52.jpg', None, '666e24c4ed0b46b2985388c7ff0195fa', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140277, 3, 'The Wedding', \"Drake and Josh are on their way to a family wedding in their car. Unexpectedly and in the middle of nowhere, the car breaks down. This wouldn't be much of a problem, if it weren't for the fact that they're the ones bringing the cake to the reception.\", '2006-10-15', 27, 7.0, 1, '/fmOzrIbWzYbQayLIrWVp6hqUP0e.jpg', None, '7171cac9441b4e49857c2baa6935af3e', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140278, 4, 'Mindy Loves Josh', 'Mindy tells Josh that she loves him and Josh slams the door in her face and runs to Drake, but Drake tells Josh that she is just trying to  distract him so she can win the Science Fair.', '2006-10-22', 27, 7.0, 1, '/9JsgHZix62fQNF6Djr4rDZZq9GE.jpg', None, 'cbe7076c69bb4fbc9e8305ea8cac445b', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087' ... 140 parameters truncated ... '/cTCzSqbuNoDcY25gtfG4gPqMjCJ.jpg', None, '95dc5362d922409bb099bcc194840d34', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 1308568, 17, 'Really Big Shrimp (1)', \"It's the end of an era. After Josh ruins Drake's chances at having a hit song in the Superbowl, the boys must find a way to make things right.\", '2007-08-03', 27, 8.0, 3, '/71DW85vDzOAAidUJcnlyooZMQKr.jpg', None, 'df700a6a0325472f8f90bff8d86ae595', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 2775279, 18, 'Really Big Shrimp (2)', \"It's the end of an era. After Josh ruins Drake's chances at having a hit song in the Superbowl, the boys must find a way to make things right.\", '2007-08-03', 27, 7.0, 2, '/aLlJe6houLA06EFVIYu5eTA5oKE.jpg', None, '2d9e7a86ca794e67a6e6b98b639b3d80', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140296, 19, 'Helicopter', \"Drake wins a free skydive off a helicopter and sets off to do it despite his parents' wishes. Josh, being the good brother he is, tries to stop him,  ... (17 characters truncated) ...  along for the ride. This fun time in the sky becomes a true downer when they accidentally lose their pilot and things start spinning out of control.\", '2007-08-05', 27, 8.0, 1, '/lYbFg76UqKXgDQX2EVuKs3monOc.jpg', None, '2a38ab8e83bc469bb76f0d6c7ecb8626', '9eabeb45424745129da8762d90bf9087', 140297, 20, 'Dance Contest', \"Josh decides to enter a local dance contest, but when Drake realizes he's going to fail gym, he has to enter in order to receive high school credit. So he steals Josh's dance partner, and that's when things start to go wrong.\", '2007-09-16', 27, 8.0, 1, '/yrVtuWJIndQDvt3HOUrjSx1ymHh.jpg', None)"}
