. (18 characters truncated) ... inue to grow closer as they wait to see if Ravi is able to reverse the effects of the cure. Lastly, Major is one step away from fulfilling a promise.\", '2017-04-25', 42, 6.375, 16, '/c25vJgZ4LH7OirgEysflk3dByW5.jpg', None, 'ede17e46488a48389d0402302ba0d47a', '0b795dae749c47e2a5d9ef5386bd88bb' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/4SwWydqJxqza2tbsDdphMHP5kil.jpg', None, '42d03975221c46f48ef706d72651fa2b', '0b795dae749c47e2a5d9ef5386bd88bb', 1320286, 10, 'Return of the Dead Guy', \"Peyton and Liv find themselves on a surprising wild goose chase. Ravi is terrified when the zombie truth hunters' plans are revealed. Elsewhere, Major finds comfort in an unexpected - and perhaps unwelcome - friend.\", '2017-06-06', 42, 7.733, 15, '/w1zB8qmcciduK8wa6ehNhBEvrNv.jpg', None, '7a80e6dddaab46588b78155aad6ff8c3', '0b795dae749c47e2a5d9ef5386bd88bb', 1320287, 11, 'Conspiracy Weary', \"Liv and Blaine come to the rescue of one of their own. They consume the brains of a conspiracy theorist and paranoia ensues. Meanwhile, as they conti ... (5 characters truncated) ... o search for conspiracy theories that may or may not exist, Liv researches Major's new friend. Finally, Ravi makes a surprising discovery of his own.\", '2017-06-13', 41, 6.75, 18, '/6s5UcT12YBsLJfDNTHxAc8tCFmx.jpg', None, '2ba269a9184c49938885e14a6a54ebd0', '0b795dae749c47e2a5d9ef5386bd88bb', 1320288, 12, 'Looking for Mr. Goodbrain (1)', \"When Liv consumes the brains of someone from Ravi's past, not only does it have her wanting to sleep with every guy in Seattle, she also begins having some very intimate visions of Ravi. Meanwhile, Major is faced with a huge decision.\", '2017-06-20', 42, 7.833, 15, '/bM4qpXF5zW8tb1CYJlqq1Iy0KEz.jpg', None, 'c5a0f7cc4b494080ace5a9e242a08747', '0b795dae749c47e2a5d9ef5386bd88bb', 1320289, 13, 'Looking for Mr. Goodbrain (2)', 'Liv uncovers the shocking truth about the virus and the far-reaching consequences of the vaccine. Majors exams his future as a human. B