{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:57.033543+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 113.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('21cbb0a713a64e31848a177df5460336', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1621456, 1, 'Thug Death', 'While investigating a murder case with no body and no brain to eat, the only evidence Liv and Clive have to work with is a grainy video and a little bit of blood found at the crime scene. Meanwhile, Blaine is up to his old tricks.', '2019-05-02', 42, 7.667, 6, '/jiAPF6r0CNyrq2Pjs3FU12cRLbb.jpg', None, 'f6f1086462334643b455ffec65a3e2d8', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1769203, 2, 'Dead Lift', 'Liv, on fitness guru brains, and Clive continue investigating a murder with no body and no evidence. Meanwhile, Peyton approaches councilman Zed with a request but doesn’t get the answer she was hoping for. Lastly, Liv surprises Major with a thoughtful gesture just when he needs it the most.', '2019-05-09', 42, 6.0, 8, '/cI0XeewMsFB3uIVy1wwC64NHN28.jpg', None, '5dd9bb5b379a4560afbe635d7b1704d5', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1776769, 3, 'Five, Six, Seven, Ate!', \"While investigating the deaths of Gulliver and Nancy, the dynamic duo of Seattle's winning dance team, Liv and Ravi go undercover as dance partners t ... (115 characters truncated) ...  of his soldiers was out of line during a routine lice check at the school. Lastly, Clive and Bozzio receive a shocking surprise during Lamaze class.\", '2019-05-16', 42, 7.857, 7, '/eQ4Rdq9hiomJ7pqGpURSoCuhUAa.jpg', None, '0d3c8aeeb9da47a89fdaee37e5eec24e', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1780479, 4, 'Dot Zom', \"Liv, Clive and Ravi investigate the suspicious death of Cornell Piercey, the head of Piercey Corp, a successful traffic app company. Melissa Schultz, ... (145 characters truncated) ... positive zombie PR in the city. Lastly, Blaine is intrigued when he meets Al Bronson of Bluster Magazine, as she is not at all what he was expecting.\", '2019-05-23', 42, 7.333, 6, '/qwtJvQQraCH8Z9M9cWxHfcpmUFm.jpg', None, '2c0465bff94b49b391a3c04cc0dc3316', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/fpWPUdi2yMD9mloCsMu4fQbChJk.jpg', None, 'b5fbbdd51c69482b90d569ffd1a8a29b', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1835623, 10, 'Night and the Zombie City', 'While investigating the murder of private eye Mick Chisel, who was stabbed in the head with an ice pick, Liv consumes Chisel’s brain in hopes of breaking down how this gruesome murder took place.', '2019-07-11', 42, 6.0, 8, '/gmTXmMms7btJuqFxaLlfE5GmdQX.jpg', None, '5ec1ee486d584e8f8c9abc0081d59ad3', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1838466, 11, 'Killer Queen', 'Liv and Clive investigate the death of an old school drag queen which leads Liv to eat and shift into the queen’s brain. Meanwhile, Ravi reaches out to Major with an interesting request.', '2019-07-18', 42, 5.875, 8, '/3zO6SRzWNbe03imtrkAEHP7XQoh.jpg', None, 'ee7dc8a11d574b07ab5c0148e0de58c5', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1844655, 12, 'Bye, Zombies', 'While Major faces a changing of the tide in Seattle, Liv, Clive and Ravi undertake a mission impossible in Atlanta to retrieve the final zombie cure.', '2019-07-25', 42, 7.833, 6, '/AtQmAcguRM4CU2rX8VtVuURLs8T.jpg', None, 'a82b3a1050f1415bbde2e95815d1ad17', 'f2bf9f45a5014e068a5b296ab4cba4a2', 1849020, 13, \"All's Well That Ends Well\", 'As Liv, Ravi and Clive race to finalize the cure, Peyton faces a showdown with Blaine, and Major takes a bold gamble to save Seattle once and for all.', '2019-08-01', 42, 8.0, 6, '/zmOO5Lp6rwg6D2IUD1NQWNKcjhH.jpg', None)"}
