{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:57.312846+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 113.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ec3287493241458fb430987c1b7505c2', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 2361923, 1, 'The Orville Panel at PaleyFest 2018', 'The cast and crew of \"The Orville\" host a panel at PaleyFest 2018 where they have a Q&A and discuss the show, its future, and more.', '2018-03-17', None, 4.0, 3, None, None, '3aacf7a96fab40cd8b61e587db25f200', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 2361924, 2, 'The First Six Missions', 'Get caught up on the first six adventures of The Orville and her crew. Originally released ahead of episode 7, this supercut was intended to quickly catch new viewers up-to-speed on the first half of Season 1.', '2017-10-26', None, 4.0, 3, None, None, 'f61fff92e1d94021a2d3c8b9d1fb1b27', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 2361925, 3, 'The Orville Inside Look', 'Go behind the scenes of \"The Orville\", featuring interviews with the cast and creative team behind the series.', '2018-12-11', None, 4.0, 3, None, None, '32f22528aa024c55a12b2c9453722b3e', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 2361926, 4, 'The Science of The Orville - Alien Life', 'More than a rubber mask, the aliens of \"The Orville\" are rooted in scientific principals about what life might look like beyond our solar system.', '2018-12-11', None, 4.0, 3, None, None, '1bcbd73f525d42db8bfbaf729a829407', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921' ... 80 parameters truncated ... None, None, '2a96be1d838d40e7abee3852e414f9fb', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 3142870, 12, 'Season 2 Deleted Scenes', None, '2018-12-25', None, 4.0, 3, None, None, '060133efc7be4c0babe52fc4d571e8c4', 'b996861715ff4e2788fb9ca4caa3d921', 4497514, 13, 'Season 2 Gag Reel', 'This is a gag reel from Season 2 contained on the Orville Season 2 DVD.\\n\\nThe DVD itself does not visually show a name in the video, but the documentation refers to it as \"Gag Reel\"', '2018-