{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:59.672454+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 116s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3d15d944ffad44d0be4ece0081f88b9d', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 3800788, 1, \"Hero's Journey\", 'The team pivots when their sting operation to secure a massive bomb from an illegal broker leads them to discover that the device is already in the wrong hands. Also, Jubal’s promise to be present at his son’s birthday party is put to the test as the case continues to heat up.', '2022-09-20', 41, 8.2, 6, '/4knxgyJ882BbMgWFU9O3jequrCi.jpg', None, '486b081666104050a64fcbba3a898c14', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 3947613, 2, 'Love Is Blind', 'When an officer is shot dead at a pawn shop along with the store’s owner, the team tries to figure out why a young, recent Ivy League dropout is tied to the crime.', '2022-09-27', 41, 8.3, 6, '/yvvSSCrQKczmQkfjov6S8R7VydM.jpg', None, '87f58cea158f449ca5d99a6168006a06', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 3947615, 3, 'Prodigal Son', 'As the team investigates a deadly robbery that garnered a cache of automatic weapons for the killers, they discover one of the perps is a classmate of Jubal’s son, who is reluctant to cooperate with the case.', '2022-10-04', 42, 8.0, 6, '/qX1eYZFkofQlhY2tv2hsociR0L3.jpg', None, 'a3c75d366f2743e592a91259be540e8f', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 3947617, 4, 'Victim', 'The team investigates a series of brutal assaults; OA hides information about his own mugging.', '2022-10-11', 41, 8.0, 5, '/lYwHSP54xcqipoMqmq17Q3MRMJG.jpg', None, '55e1ebaac18d489fa49c8861eefe9628', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec' ... 176 parameters truncated ... '/76APcyhd5RudNrW7Vo9JzRdVSWX.jpg', None, 'd7b3769e5fb2404399c6d6226b1ec206', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 4330061, 20, 'Sisterhood', \"A drug dealer is shot in a federal park  and the team sets out to look for his killer; Maggie's sister returns to New York and complicates the case.\", '2023-04-25', 43, 7.8, 4, '/4zgaqiMJaeeCUdSRP3UWgHJPr7d.jpg', None, 'e5e5f52c79fd4e13b882de805033d4a7', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 4330062, 21, 'Privilege', 'All eyes are on the team when they try to find out who kidnapped the only child of a prominent U.S senator. The abduction also uncovers a potential link to a similar case that was pushed to the side by local authorities.', '2023-05-09', 43, 7.8, 6, '/lqembmcm9ko3EAhMvwEM3wWrC0Y.jpg', None, 'e3fc5519ee3f4c11acb576d044e40431', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 4330065, 22, 'Torn', 'After finding a group of teens dead from a drug overdose, the team races to find the dangerous dealer and his supplier. Meanwhile, OA questions where he stands in his faith.', '2023-05-16', 40, 7.8, 4, '/6zAuxGjjPy1rf8vRvoKFrh8TnHr.jpg', None, 'b2cd6df9f98e4d17a5e8a8e436617bb3', '64ba2518f6304c3ebb81285133f06eec', 4330066, 23, 'God Complex', 'When a prominent doctor is found dead in a ritualistic slaying, the team must race against time to hunt down a religiously motivated serial killer. Also, Scola faces a life-or-death decision.', '2023-05-23', 42, 7.8, 4, '/teLAUtXiJdr0ceR9aHbq2SZZs7J.jpg', None)"}
