{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:00.480550+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 116.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('56ef18006402498d8ece67ba81fc4b5f', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 5474913, 1, 'Abandoned', 'The assassination of a seemingly ordinary Brooklyn plumber launches the team into a globe-spanning investigation that ruffles feathers with the CIA.', '2024-10-15', 42, 7.7, 8, '/psVm08hcq385NMtbBgcMQLzOE0g.jpg', None, '39c0e371a7f0452cbc0e4543b0bbd182', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 5672109, 2, 'Trusted', \"The team is on the case when a suburban couple is murdered and all forensic evidence points to the home's previous owner, who is currently serving 10 years in federal prison.\", '2024-10-22', 42, 7.6, 7, '/euRmdqJyw3NVReLYPade24FbNC9.jpg', None, '0f8cb15fcfa3492aad23ff3e4be1130c', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 5693577, 3, 'Détente', \"After a series of targeted bombings in Queens, the team fears a citywide gang war is imminent – until a tip from OA's old Army buddy, Clay, directs their attention to an unexpected and powerful foe. Meanwhile, Scola continues to struggle to find a new partner.\", '2024-10-29', 41, 8.0, 7, '/7zspNoS56uOygCx1wfGUSDLhueg.jpg', None, 'a423bd4a29cf4fe6a7d9d20133c07778', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 5693578, 4, 'Doubted', 'When the sister of Sydney Ortiz is the victim of an attempted kidnapping and sexual assault, Sydney seeks help from Isobel and the team in tracking down a meticulous serial offender who leaves no evidence behind.', '2024-11-12', 41, 7.7, 7, '/t8wNHN8gCVn6jHpNkgTYWvNRnIf.jpg', None, 'b9c5d381a6f64fe78b09c84584933e07', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/1FQrlC6I3p1oyCq24Uix42RE8RN.jpg', None, '651b495253c745fbb29f76da20558d6d', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 6039166, 19, 'Partner', 'After a young girl goes missing in Queens, the team discovers the kidnappers used her as leverage to carry out a major explosives heist, sending them on a hunt for the dangerous culprits. Meanwhile, Scola and Dani begin working on their footing as partners.', '2025-04-22', 42, 8.0, 7, '/vWYbELHhWIq9Ol7FxvFZGO94MTJ.jpg', None, '80ff5ca658be4282ab2c8f86f76c2093', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 6090787, 20, 'Startup', 'When a CEO is killed by a targeted explosion inside his penthouse, the team must work to figure out how someone accessed the highly secure building.  ... (25 characters truncated) ... plicated when they discover the crime may be the work of an artificial intelligence program. Meanwhile, Maggie pumps the brakes on her personal life.', '2025-05-06', 42, 8.1, 7, '/wosoXwekwXFMZ8RhNDjgGeAHocA.jpg', None, 'a31e6c5c494641fdbb982f3e7e5b397d', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 6090788, 21, 'Devoted', 'When two IRS special agents are stabbed to death in Brooklyn, the team is thrown into an investigation that leads back to the resurgence of the online conspiracy community of Duke Ducoyle, their suspect from a previous case.', '2025-05-13', 42, 8.0, 7, '/zRhXP0rrpy6xQ6RZ7rz1bC9chjv.jpg', None, '2cb4b036ecfe4d72860a1b80b83f76c5', 'd3f7085c37b943fdb5163d02cb5d7b02', 6072513, 22, 'A New Day', 'After Jubal narrowly escapes a calculated assault on a secret FBI office, the team discovers a rogue terrorist group has infiltrated the FBI. Unsure of who to trust, the team must work in the shadows to unmask the culprits threatening the sanctity of the New York field office.', '2025-05-20', 42, 8.0, 6, '/j55ArRmmLuEkPhE7OvThyfF5bDP.jpg', None)"}
