{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:00.858180+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 117.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('cb4cc62dddff4b9693b7c6a0b48b497b', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 6374509, 1, 'Takeover', \"After a federal judge disappears, a routine investigation takes a dark turn as the team uncovers that the judge had been searching for his missing so ... (2 characters truncated) ... on a secluded island on the city's edge, where authority has crumbled. Meanwhile, reality weighs heavy on Jubal as he takes on a new leadership role.\", '2025-10-13', 43, 8.3, 3, '/E4IKqbQJB3BzII1BRWSJRxx4Mg.jpg', None, 'aa4aeaa34dec44ff900d0f26d7361765', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 6488869, 2, 'Captured', 'When paintings from a high-profile international cultural exchange are stolen – leaving a security guard dead – the team races to recover the priceless artworks. Meanwhile, Maggie turns to a friend for help profiling suspects.', '2025-10-20', 43, 8.0, 2, '/eNdF5NCRpwGBzBEQpC7jTlBDLq6.jpg', None, 'c3e25c0f5db9461d970eca367fee10ed', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 6588813, 3, 'Boy Scout', 'After a young man is found beaten to death on federal land, Scola and Special Agent Eva Ramos hit a roadblock when their case intersects with a DEA operation. Meanwhile, there is a potential shake-up inside of the JOC.', '2025-10-27', 43, 8.5, 3, '/9JFeY7lIXIm6iKmRobGRt64EHgV.jpg', None, '4800b78faaf74c7680f1bcddf75eadea', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 6588814, 4, 'Manifest', 'Following a failed assassination attempt on a U.S. Senator, OA and Maggie are tasked with escorting her back to DC on a flight that becomes more perilous than imagined.', '2025-11-03', 43, 8.3, 3, '/upcT1rF05OrsyRhtookKPSMO8gq.jpg', None, '819bde2411f94f0ca13ef7f05f3998a5', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/fT8IT5rrSlpPHW1PxrCR1PYq9K3.jpg', None, '43e3230c940a4616b651a70d4427e48b', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 7095316, 19, 'Fidelity', 'When an FBI evidence locker is robbed, leaving behind a dead ERT agent, the team discovers a vigilante duo looking to take down a high-scale pedophile ring. Meanwhile, Isobel meets the new Assistant Director in Charge.', '2026-04-27', 43, 8.7, 3, '/ioffvBVx7xU9pyTA4AIy3KrJFdS.jpg', None, '2582c9dc9a554db3bc9fad946b13791d', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 7095317, 20, 'Roleplay', \"When a big city donor is murdered inside her apartment, the team tracks down the young killer who leads them into a crypto scam he's been running with one of his victims, looking to seek revenge on his family.\", '2026-05-04', 43, 8.7, 3, '/hiT6ML4DjH8duMno9dghtjOkUSQ.jpg', None, '5602d72f73614dcd9f6a029e319fdbc8', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 7095318, 21, 'Long Shot', 'Following the assassination of a major corporate executive, the team races to find leaders of a dormant terrorist organization that has reemerged. Meanwhile, OA is temporarily reassigned after refusing to follow orders but is paired up with a familiar face.', '2026-05-11', 43, 7.7, 3, '/pAuEVM8FwTLrDjPl0vlF74ZxvMv.jpg', None, 'c364ed34d60b4d64bbf5a02f59f9a3fc', '2e99a718fa654cd1ac02f365e9e216a1', 7095319, 22, 'Defector', 'The theft of a bioweapon from an unwitting defector forces the team to work with an old foe to secure the lethal pathogen and prevent an outbreak across New York City.', '2026-05-18', 43, 9.0, 4, '/5aGuGHyUQ5bFAOJvPbIAGco8oQc.jpg', None)"}
