{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:04.022784+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 120.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('fba1d3a5e5f54501839b8787e2e3c089', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 3870731, 1, 'Almost Like a Prayer', 'Reeling from the grief of a failed adoption, the Barnett family gets a second chance when they get a call about a little girl named Natalia.', '2025-03-19', 50, 7.696, 92, '/7ofruXvqzH2LLdKowAGN3tRaqf1.jpg', None, '7f26cd35a9304cc184bcc2cb02f9c765', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946873, 2, 'Jump the Jitters Out', \"Natalia starts school, and Kristine's suspicions about the adoption deepen. Michael receives unexpected news at work.\", '2025-03-19', 52, 7.1, 17, '/61FwbS2eg2mW7beUnXtOKvcqPeh.jpg', None, '9c4ff501a6e6406a96f321303e4a6547', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946874, 3, 'Ghosts Everywhere', \"Kristine investigates Natalia's age. As she doubles down on her suspicions, Jacob's star rises and Michael's web of lies spins further.\", '2025-03-26', 49, 7.0, 10, '/oMpahiPtnCpggapBG9bDEHxjsff.jpg', None, '27e8b08e77934662ae2bb435a61dc0e2', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946875, 4, 'Right There in Black and White', \"Michael and Kristine's marriage reaches a breaking point as their differing perspectives on Natalia threaten to tear them apart. When the stakes become dangerous, Kristine draws a line.\", '2025-04-02', 47, 6.6, 9, '/Au98P49IQh5W0WqFJxPeOhwLTj8.jpg', None, '67272f91791340c380ba72e72848b8d1', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946876, 5, 'Too Hurty Without It', 'Left to her own devices, Natalia faces her new circumstances and how the world sees her.', '2025-04-09', 47, 7.4, 9, '/sCLmel6D8nlRZ5E9bXo8lqQnNB0.jpg', None, 'a325a9be7a8b4b0ead0349fb10c6e4b3', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946877, 6, 'Not Today Satan', 'Natalia questions whether she can trust an unexpected set of allies. As questions about her past arise, painful memories are unearthed.', '2025-04-16', 51, 6.8, 8, '/ufHRJOLeGwCoXMRHw5NE8m3MwpI.jpg', None, '087263d464304ba5b74d42a859425fe3', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946878, 7, 'If You Tell a Story Well Enough', \"Just as the Barnetts think they've distanced themselves from Natalia, Detective Drysdale takes up her case to challenge her re-aging.\", '2025-04-23', 57, 7.1, 9, '/gZ7c1LBQf6BlxfZLAslnAPewef0.jpg', None, '5c8d3cedf8374148af8d4c8047f5192b', '4d6a978c06854c06a2f5d63fa1985525', 5946879, 8, 'Blood on Her Hands', 'With the world watching, Natalia and the Barnetts face off in the court of law and the court of public opinion.', '2025-04-30', 62, 7.2, 9, '/xtRBbfqfxMuvms50GOWd8zlUueE.jpg', None)"}
