{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:04.916095+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 121.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('18f7b82423f346418e84688a3cfedeb8', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 4328324, 1, 'One', 'Sidelined by PTSD, Special Forces veteran John Creasy gets a second chance when an old friend hires him to investigate a terrorist plot in Brazil.', '2026-04-30', 50, 4.9, 25, '/7nDn3sPwuibz6pQbNPGLELdYuBg.jpg', None, '6fcdec2d714e4911be0ce86d3b1d88a7', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 5408708, 2, 'Two', 'As they face relentless attacks from all sides, Creasy tries to help Poe reclaim her memories — and discovers no one can really be trusted.', '2026-04-30', 50, 5.3, 24, '/kCMOJwKNERmsSJUv1IBO8jnjb6O.jpg', None, '09fb749840b04963aaeaaa1cd800acbb', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 7024853, 3, 'Three', \"Creasy leverages Tiago to gain access to Osmar's hideout. Poe befriends a sensitive teen enlisted to protect her from the dangers of the favela.\", '2026-04-30', 45, 4.9, 17, '/4rZFkL2Io3YWRUrcBQBOOqyyxn5.jpg', None, 'c4eca89a7f9a43d8af24bd19f5e91bc2', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 7024854, 4, 'Four', 'The favela goes on high alert when enemies arrive with an agenda. Creasy races against time to extract information in a high-stakes hostage situation.', '2026-04-30', 43, 4.4, 17, '/wNPOZAlduGULcdrhIoDRXXBPKee.jpg', None, '6cf7c5370f4e47e4b0e90dd699ada3e8', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 7024855, 5, 'Five', 'With a new adversary on his trail, Creasy hatches a plan to get Poe and the others out of the country. Vico offers Livro a chance at a fresh start.', '2026-04-30', 45, 4.971, 17, '/kZhrE3WDmrLGAFRKU74kQo713qL.jpg', None, '079dfcf58f2949e587c9c43608aadaee', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 7024856, 6, 'Six', 'Creasy stages a daring prison heist to secure an important target. Melo takes the wheel for a dangerous rescue mission.', '2026-04-30', 44, 3.972, 17, '/90DvGYKcQZ2qcTl8I9jB14NSBZX.jpg', None, '30cb6a384d5e443c83c52b4ae2303ffe', '053b10c938144c7f8e25c5307e4d4cc4', 7024857, 7, 'Seven', 'Cornered and exposed, Creasy sets a trap to lure his enemies into the flames — even if it means he burns alongside them.', '2026-04-30', 60, 4.738, 21, '/8IL1qEpg5vM2le0HcOCa8MYiq25.jpg', None)"}
