{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:08.975712+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 125.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('908558df504c462ea9039432b45b178f', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 3148636, 1, 'Prequel 1: I Am Dr. Rachel Scott', 'Having just discovered a new virus that could drive man to extinction, a young doctor begins a video journal to track her progress in preventing a global pandemic.', '2014-06-02', 2, 10.0, 0, None, None, 'a2111eb31ca8494e9ee45b539f9a8595', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 3148638, 2, 'Prequel 2: It May Pre-Date Humankind', 'Dr. Scott outlines her theory on how global warming might have exposed the modern world to an ancient virus to which we have no natural immunity.', '2014-06-02', 2, 10.0, 1, None, None, '6a3b07c14cd146d6bdbb3b6620bf2fd5', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 3148640, 3, 'Prequel 3: Can You Still Hear Me?', 'Dr. Scott pleads with her government benefactors for a ship to take her to the arctic so she can trace the deadly virus to its possible source.', '2014-06-09', 2, 0.0, 0, None, None, '582d44a07984424cb3188900423c93c0', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 3148642, 4, 'Prequel 4: The Clock Is Ticking', \"Despite ridicule from her fellow scientists, Dr. Scott's concern over the new virus is amplified by the discovery of three new cases outside the original hot zone.\", '2014-06-09', 2, 10.0, 1, None, None, '66dc331d2268484b93520dd694fb61e2', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c' ... 8 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'c61db7d1480e45f59a000ec107c051a4', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 3148646, 6, 'Prequel 6: A Proper Goodbye', 'About to board the USS Nathan James, Dr. Rachel Scott imparts a final note of urgency about the threat that mankind faces, revealing that the fate of humanity hangs on the success of her mission.', '2014-06-16', 2, 10.0, 0, None, None, '7ce3824e95264d79a1e5adb47b84cc53', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 6945386, 7, 'Character profile: Eric Dane (Captain Tom Chandler)', 'Eric Dane discusses his role as U.S. Navy Captain Tom Chandler.', '2014-06-09', 2, 0.0, 0, '/v06YPQuTR34xRtkUi3YJYTnOJ74.jpg', None, '28f01a1ffb1940078a47438ad697ab15', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 6945388, 8, 'Character Profile: Rhona Mitra (Dr. Rachel Scott)', 'Rhona Mitra discusses her role as Dr. Rachel Scott.', '2014-06-09', 2, 10.0, 1, '/vMwBwpQUUFTzcmvK6bPoT8RCuzM.jpg', None, '6ed2712249dd44dc88ac3766c0d4f942', '4214e2a6f4b6411a9faafe69f86c241c', 6945389, 9, 'Character Profile: Adam Baldwin (XO Mike Slattery)', 'Adam Baldwin discusses his role as XO Mike Slattery.', '2014-06-09', 2, 0.0, 0, '/oWafdg5146yQhA3bakJNXeywSgy.jpg', None)"}
