{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:32.056798+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 148.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('968acb81c8504f3e9b7a4a6edbdb5c49', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 4794584, 1, 'Once Upon a Time in the West', \"Charles, Oliver & Mabel are whisked to Los Angeles where a legendary film studio intends to adapt their podcast. However, Hollywood's glitz is overshadowed by a stunning clue about Charles' stunt double & friend Sazz Pataki.\", '2024-08-27', 39, 9.3, 115, '/d2GVzgYcxBEklD6FKysPn86wA9S.jpg', None, '80a4f21d49b0478faff18580a4c98caa', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541139, 2, 'Gates of Heaven', \"Mabel & Oliver begin investigating Arconia's West Tower and get trapped inside an ominous game. Meanwhile, Charles is visited by two individuals from his complex past.\", '2024-09-03', 37, 9.6, 107, '/wGiB2KxjoQNHBX694D5HmN96OCB.jpg', None, 'ac0f9e40a1504f74bf62c30e1c421710', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541140, 3, 'Two for the Road', 'Charles, Oliver & Mabel begrudgingly pair off with new investigators... actors Eugene Levy, Zach Galifianakis & Eva Longoria.', '2024-09-10', 41, 9.3, 96, '/hFFm3oLHDCCKiQ0KF5IDr6tqPbj.jpg', None, 'd3beb5dec9fe46d289006e73cc79d016', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541142, 4, 'The Stunt Man', 'Charles, Oliver & Mabel delve into the particular universe of stunt people. They encounter a suspect with an incredibly... familiar... face.', '2024-09-17', 36, 9.3, 93, '/d3aCkmmdUBQCg4W6P3TfgG9yFdE.jpg', None, 'b2f2cded216b4cdb8f117e8f1617414d', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/x2me4ypEefYLCpXwrMp6XMZ72PS.jpg', None, '572ad529702a4051bd6761c759e78e72', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541145, 7, 'Valley of the Dolls', \"Terrified by a threat inside the Arconia, the trio race out of the city. A member of Charles' family provides refuge and yet, this safe house proves to be anything but.\", '2024-10-08', 40, 9.4, 92, '/vIuDNy5hIBcYS7w4Jgqstcgxcmr.jpg', None, '79954f6c3687449dac015b2ff6ac0464', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541146, 8, 'Lifeboat', \"Charles, Oliver & Mabel combine forces with the film actors in an epic showdown against the Westies. You can't handle the truth.\", '2024-10-15', 37, 9.3, 92, '/goJk9n8MCQtnFiUQm5EFeNXhyn8.jpg', None, 'a116c51c83cd4c08b733f05f64431c93', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541147, 9, 'Escape from Planet Klongo', 'Seeking a critical clue, Charles, Oliver & Mabel must infiltrate a film set to get the real \"background\" on why Sazz was killed.', '2024-10-22', 35, 9.5, 92, '/hbAReQru1dtcZv0Lam3JoA1NwVY.jpg', None, 'e081d32f8fb3437e8e77ae52eaffc003', 'b394cdf6121b49e1bb00dcc03e46d6ac', 5541148, 10, \"My Best Friend's Wedding\", 'The final answers to our season are revealed - but not before the trio faces mortal danger and an Arconia wedding.', '2024-10-29', 37, 9.4, 92, '/uOjLiiBrRtk8YTxsex1CCI4JQYE.jpg', None)"}
