{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:33.011937+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 149.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ad773915e3dd4ce298410f0160a6b183', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251508, 1, 'Smarty Pants', 'Alex and Harper enter an academic competition, but Alex wears \"smarty pants\" that give her all of the answers. At first it\\'s great, but Alex soon realizes that her cheating doesn\\'t allow Harper to shine. Meanwhile, Max tries to con everybody at school into buying his water bottles.', '2008-09-12', 23, 9.2, 12, '/m0KddhldoqGcVcrzDrGQv6xFG3Z.jpg', None, '6e35af049e35439f90e82ae4129dcaf3', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251499, 2, 'Beware Wolf', 'Justin falls for a new girl who is a werewolf and turns him into one, too; Max starts a dog-walking business with a new friend.', '2008-09-21', 23, 9.1, 10, '/dt4rYLslKQTq39AQGHThSCjudOu.jpg', None, 'abb99c193a164ed4ae0a4552ab236305', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251513, 3, 'Graphic Novel', \"Justin and Max steal Alex's diary only to have it stolen again by Gigi, Alex's arch nemesis. In an attempt to recover the diary, the brothers accidentally place Gigi inside the book and into Alex's secret fairy-tale princess world.\", '2008-10-05', 23, 9.0, 12, '/dczgnimVPlInFeYiXk4VSg9fUAN.jpg', None, 'fdc2fd75710c4f1d9169bd16dce457a5', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251506, 4, 'Racing', 'Alex uses the restoration and upcoming race of Jerry\\'s junky old car as an opportunity to develop her relationship with her \"gear head\" crush, Dean. Meanwhile, Max orders a mind-reading kit.', '2008-10-12', 23, 9.0, 10, '/iKcv6mBQxzqUOKZil67dAFuH5PW.jpg', None, 'd3dfbe4931484d53b0d98f49860fd122', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d' ... 260 parameters truncated ... '/5Or81DrhHAss4JLK1cIfWSmccy8.jpg', None, '3630b38debc74c038b7469ba5834b42f', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251531, 27, 'Wizards vs. Vampires: Tasty Bites', \"Justin's new vampire girlfriend Juliet gets the Russos to change their lifestyle by adding healthy foods and exercise. However Alex is concerned about Juliet's true intentions for Justin when she discovers that vampires like the taste of healthy blood.\", '2009-07-31', 23, 9.1, 10, '/ocG4SEwVheg3pdAeOpMZLLWNf9L.jpg', None, 'adc5229f2fd74bae9cb30ea6bf53e13f', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251533, 28, 'Wizards vs. Vampires: Dream Date', \"After Dean moves away, Alex continues to date him by using magic to enter his dreams. When he pays her a surprise visit and the real date isn't as gr ... (28 characters truncated) ... earches for a way to break up with him. Meanwhile Justin tells his vampire girlfriend Juliet that he is not allowed to go on her family camping trip.\", '2009-08-07', 23, 9.2, 12, '/5YjVQ9t8o0NsSg5LK3IT6yCi8aM.jpg', None, '3b5a1740e24d40beb4f918870f9c927d', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251537, 29, 'Wizards and Vampires vs. Zombies', 'Justin promises Juliet an unforgettable prom date. But when Alex organizes a zombie-themed anti-prom, things get out of hand when real zombies arrive. Meanwhile, Harper and Zeke go to the prom together.', '2009-08-08', 23, 9.1, 11, '/z0J9lqFs5Hz2cAqGnjTrFU9zgP6.jpg', None, 'dbf385f8b9f8460e863a9d9bb51a430f', 'e49b0039122542468a3d7bf022885c9d', 251552, 30, 'Retest', 'Jerry and his siblings, Kelbo and Megan (Jerry revealed to the kids they have an aunt), need to retake the Wizard test that, in their teen years, det ... (29 characters truncated) ...  powers. When Alex, Justin and Max see how competitive the contest gets, they realize the same test could eventually tear their family apart as well.', '2009-08-21', 23, 8.9, 12, '/mOkDaCKTdRuYKwZWAYuo4EOTrCD.jpg', None)"}
