{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:33.888675+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 150.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('855be8b1e8b84887a68671cea9f8946a', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251667, 1, 'Alex Tells the World', \"After the government has taken all the wizards away, Alex decides to reveal wizards to the world. The rest of the wizarding world doesn't exactly take well to it.\", '2010-11-12', 23, 8.8, 13, '/p9sS2DmX989HKoo7CvOZ1qZ2Fm8.jpg', None, 'd16b37bb328048819abf728e18ea2c46', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251668, 2, 'Alex Gives Up', 'Alex quits her wizard training after she decides there will never be enough time to regain her status and compete for the title of family wizard. How ... (246 characters truncated) ... f back in the running for the wizard competition. And a family of Cucuys, Latino mythical monsters, invites the Russos for an evening on their yacht.', '2010-11-27', 23, 9.0, 12, '/kBIFmcTmH2hbubzQW57OmRU3kRQ.jpg', None, '1eeb13ffd0724a26a4bedf83d3b198a0', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251669, 3, 'Lucky Charmed', \"Alex continues her life as a mortal but it causes tension between her and Harper. Meanwhile, a magical robe of Jerry's is found torn into pieces\", '2010-12-10', 23, 9.1, 12, '/ll0SPi4PRjw1Pe0YrMwjizZUNtn.jpg', None, '63c493db95d74ea7ab5d4ccfac943811', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251671, 4, 'Journey to the Center of Mason', \"Alex and Mason try to be just friends but that's hard when Dean returns and Mason gets jealous. Meanwhile, Justin tries to motivate some wizards.\", '2010-12-17', 23, 9.1, 12, '/gRCWyUeYI6dMYr051Z7vPiuQ7uh.jpg', None, 'a12cb22a2ea74fd3a188e40e09630f26', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb' ... 224 parameters truncated ... '/kya2cHh4v9kUukHUu2wFApyznrb.jpg', None, 'df8019d090324d06a833a0e3ff8f3c62', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251665, 24, 'Wizards vs. Everything', 'After Dexter reveals himself as Gorog, the angel of darkness, he turns Felix evil in order to use his powerful wand to take over the Wizard World. Alex, Justin and Max learn from Professor Crumbs that they must use their wizard powers together to defeat Gorog and the dark side.', '2011-10-28', 23, 9.1, 13, '/vwnUeTvn0iLYeWO1r9dLEeUyfuw.jpg', None, '09af13ef3b3043e3aad44a8e8b4d7174', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251696, 25, 'Rock Around the Clock', 'The family goes back in time to try and save their lair.', '2011-11-04', 23, 8.9, 16, '/h9MdatckRa28qWV8tYuwhMwKoTO.jpg', None, '428955191fc846018275eac489697d6d', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251492, 26, 'Harperella', 'Harper gets zapped into a Cinderella Book.', '2011-11-18', 23, 9.4, 12, '/dOajrn2ToNPK78U6e9BJ6MjT8nA.jpg', None, 'ba39f332ec2a4099a0e0879e9ebbdeb6', '981aa68717fc476aa296b6b9b27dc8fb', 251698, 27, 'Who Will Be the Family Wizard?', 'During a dinner that Alex made for the family, Headmaster Crumbs visits to reveal that with this selfless act, the Russo children can finally have their family wizard competition.', '2012-01-06', 51, 9.7, 13, '/rFxCsTdolHHqOcZFjuO9xEFmR2P.jpg', None)"}
