{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:35.684199+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 152s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a368b1ded9314fb99dcac563c346c84e', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1057663, 1, 'eps1.0_hellofriend.mov', \"Elliot, a cyber-security engineer by day and vigilante hacker by night, is recruited by a mysterious underground group to destroy the firm he's paid to protect. Elliot must decide how far he'll go to expose the forces he believes are running (and ruining) the world.\", '2015-06-24', 65, 8.2, 198, '/lNXkxjiVwWKXalBcDCpntXBBfOh.jpg', None, 'c38834032b114f439df4f97bcb598cbf', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1071733, 2, 'eps1.1_ones-and-zer0es.mpeg', 'Elliot is torn between accepting a job offer from Evil Corp and joining the fsociety hacker group. At the same time Elliot needs to make decision that could harm people around him.', '2015-07-01', 48, 7.8, 158, '/rjM4hZGeTSG1ckxWa91DBUIWD5S.jpg', None, '8d6461275bf34c19ad433c7850119d60', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1073094, 3, 'eps1.2_d3bug.mkv', \"Elliot tries to lead a normal life, but can't escape fsociety. Gideon, meanwhile, grows suspicious, and Tyrell plays dirty.\", '2015-07-08', 46, 7.5, 150, '/hXTn6GbzIWcHBas0jQNOvJMofZN.jpg', None, '9b58e0612a114c1d888bfceba1daedf2', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1073095, 4, 'eps1.3_da3m0ns.mp4', \"Elliot's inner-demons threaten an fsociety operation.\", '2015-07-15', 46, 7.3, 146, '/2nRIQc1kKfS5RTkLeVQYJauW3QU.jpg', None, '8b6638fe50d64313b38da6a0fc1c605a', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/1RjEUBkw9Xnsq8doMw9K2NnRmsX.jpg', None, '6766348bb2c84342b87ee493a03d65fa', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1073098, 7, 'eps1.6_v1ew-s0urce.flv', 'Elliott goes missing. Mr. Robot tries to pull fsociety back together. Angela goes head-to-head with an old nemesis.', '2015-08-05', 45, 7.7, 128, '/8Ap8xEHmk9rJ5DqN6c9enca7sVP.jpg', None, '98b0500ec98045c9ba1fcfeb09123c35', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1073099, 8, 'eps1.7_wh1ter0se.m4v', \"Allsafe is controlled, the Dark Army is ready to meet Elliot & Tyrell and Joanna's plan goes into effect.\", '2015-08-12', 46, 8.4, 137, '/tlMYjW7bTMizWFlvsnt2yAEOgWw.jpg', None, 'c9b7c3293f424eceb2ed68940264791d', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1073100, 9, 'eps1.8_m1rr0r1ng.qt', \"The Evil Corp hack is threatened by a mystery man from Elliot's past.\", '2015-08-19', 45, 8.3, 130, '/giXxuHQ9LhcndP3caA5nGD3IMI2.jpg', None, '5a16e8ce04af410c82322f24a91e5da2', '7fb949d6994b42c995c13b520f82888f', 1078805, 10, 'eps1.9_zer0-day.avi', 'Mr. Robot and Tyrell are MIA and a past hack haunts Elliot.', '2015-09-02', 54, 7.9, 127, '/hNpNO4IchQMWyhgS1Lt9QX3TBwl.jpg', None)"}
