{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:35.841115+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 152.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b01c6cd4122a420591b30a2d7afdb2e7', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1187600, 1, 'eps2.0_unm4sk-pt1.tc', 'one month later and omfg, five/nine changed the world. elliot in seclusion. darlene takes the lead. fsociety delivers malicious payload. TANGO DOWN? tbc.', '2016-07-13', 41, 7.7, 115, '/tZJEVPYBtkcYctpqVDlAyR4nNY3.jpg', None, 'd58d83ccff27486ea263885c26fdc617', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1195316, 2, 'eps2.0_unm4sk-pt2.tc', 'angela happy at evil corp. tyrell MIA and joanna has a new bf? wtf? dom leads fbi investigation into five/nine. elliot demands answers from mr. robot.', '2016-07-13', 42, 7.7, 115, '/dmC940qVfZyRwObYnRYIezqBZFz.jpg', None, '9cac33450ac948eeb7103a44bce931e2', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1195317, 3, 'eps2.1_k3rnel-pan1c.ksd', 'elliot vows to beat mr. robot but it aint easy, smh. angela sees behind the scenes at evil corp. sh*t', '2016-07-20', 64, 7.8, 114, '/iSKjRqP0nfBjS1rP4OOT2wWhgYN.jpg', None, 'bb16b2332cf34889809b2ea86e452167', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1195318, 4, 'eps2.2_init_1.asec', 'elliot friends ray, hopes he can help finally delete mr. robot. dom makes a big discovery. darlene wonders whos the bigger threat-- fbi or dark army?', '2016-07-27', 66, 7.9, 104, '/lGMk2uU1cuzybVKwNQXyRunTq7y.jpg', None, '58d1e5abd4884802bc0f44053d83d731', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19' ... 44 parameters truncated ... '/2YfhnDVZDjd4UGGjRupDVBsYxmJ.jpg', None, 'a5432ee9794844689362f6d4cba1d98f', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1195323, 9, 'eps2.7_init_5.fve', 'angela wants more from evil corp than they want to give her. unsure if dark army is working w/ or against them, elliot and darlene seek answers. the truth is out there.', '2016-08-31', 49, 8.2, 105, '/p0i7MIpPXxM449A2hJc48AECZyR.jpg', None, '40bd923f983f4d0c827a040213a742cd', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1195324, 10, 'eps2.8_h1dden-pr0cess.axx', 'elliot starts to wonder if mr. robot has been lying to him. darlene tries to do the right thing. dom and fbi get closer.', '2016-09-07', 43, 8.5, 104, '/lC6CqL386ntGwi6jkJCTHPtnrYS.jpg', None, '315c94d932df42d286ca28b423b5dbb1', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1204470, 11, 'eps2.9_pyth0n-pt1.p7z', 'angela makes an unexpected acquaintance. elliot does the same. dom engages in an interesting ama.', '2016-09-14', 48, 8.1, 103, '/iJh2GC7fyIQv8V3MYVoVLcUjeIT.jpg', None, '310dbe9ffdb046038a84eb78c44510e1', '4cb583f1014347fabeed96cd986b0c19', 1204471, 12, 'eps2.9_pyth0n-pt2.p7z', 'fsociety is in too deep rn. an old friend reveals all to elliot. sh*t gets real af.', '2016-09-21', 48, 8.3, 103, '/ccTAczqSjtHjJFuKVIXS84PjgcU.jpg', None)"}
