{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:36.057702+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 152.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('25aef3c8ba2645ebbfc2ada46fb82645', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1351228, 1, 'eps3.0_power-saver-mode.h', 'elliot gets woke. realizes his mission. needs help from angela. darlene freaks about them coming out clean. and who tf is this irving guy?', '2017-10-11', 54, 8.1, 96, '/8ZvIFsT3GFHjaiZ7JLaDD7co5F3.jpg', None, '347f6a36013940dea01307e46280e877', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1351229, 2, 'eps3.1_undo.gz', 'elliot is lit by his goal to ctrl+z five/nine. darlene meets rock + hard place. mr. robot sparks a panic.', '2017-10-18', 48, 8.4, 90, '/k2Ktv1CgT8UZif5rENxBf395qSN.jpg', None, '021c8b8f383547db84b256da509d18c1', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1351688, 3, 'eps3.2_legacy.so', 'hi. im tyrell wellick. former interim CTO of E Corp. ive been gone for a while. its time for an AMA!', '2017-10-25', 50, 8.2, 86, '/cPZAfgWRP0RxNHw6cE3eEr1knRB.jpg', None, '8bc3c3fa01674e47946819205794eec0', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1379015, 4, 'eps3.3_metadata.par2', 'dom has a close call. elliot chases himself with darlene on the lookout. mr. robot doesn’t have a need for swede. angela gets savage AF.', '2017-11-01', 47, 7.8, 82, '/n2lU9BoMU44ggA6GlayiPKdBrbU.jpg', None, '683dc8d6e7064cb5b229bc5c25c710ed', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/jrQbrrQBARKHClODO8bH8gDxBwW.jpg', None, 'aba5879f53ca4ec5a05728c144399332', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1379020, 7, 'eps3.6_fredrick+tanya.chk', 'mr. robot wants answers. price < whiterose. fbi closes in. knight time in the desert. angela hits the rewind button. a lot.', '2017-11-22', 48, 8.3, 88, '/82uEJqvH6FbiqipG9IYztePMRbO.jpg', None, '9e8b96d5ba094cccbff2bae35bd3aa1d', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1379022, 8, 'eps3.7_dont-delete-me.ko', 'elliot tries to get ghosted. FWIW it’s the day of all days.', '2017-11-29', 47, 8.3, 94, '/wlpJLbBqQKhVepnAuFxaK9h8cJd.jpg', None, 'ba3a9ab0d4564c60893d15e65a5ec231', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1379023, 9, 'eps3.8_stage3.torrent', 'elliot trolls a former ally. mr. robot leaves cryptic txt. tyrell gets new cmds. tbh darlene’s plan is next level risky biz.', '2017-12-06', 49, 8.0, 87, '/lE50225dvp4QkSCMs7OasuPCqep.jpg', None, '01a0def53d384bc19e000e8dcb0da449', '747e41d4e3ba4bddbb0aef6b087730b5', 1379024, 10, 'shutdown -r', 'elliot tries to save darlene but sh*t doesn’t go as planned. mr. robot needs to step up or step back ffs. angela considers the price.', '2017-12-13', 58, 8.7, 89, '/jCqtwadu6axZY0sYYP2QGC9u15f.jpg', None)"}
