{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:15:36.887057+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 153.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f06bd57b7d9a495699312833c8886a9f', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893628, 1, 'Is It Him?', \"The search for a killer lands June back in Hegarty's orbit, who has a proposition for her: Join his intelligence operation to find her man.\", '2026-04-22', 43, 3.9, 15, '/goZYZCtNd5yAyhc8xwFY3h183MT.jpg', None, '31e98cf4ed884f488840e62718645ffb', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893629, 2, 'Firestarters', \"Hegarty brings June into his plan to use Billy as an undercover asset. June's home life starts to unravel.\", '2026-04-29', 49, 3.6, 14, '/p5PKJM3Lz9r97cFn8uTWbWej0bV.jpg', None, 'fe7babdcbcf94303ac5ff59d189a779f', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893630, 3, 'Snakes and Ladders', \"With Billy embedded in Cosmo Thompson's far-right group, Operation Samphire is underway. A key piece of evidence in June's case surfaces.\", '2026-05-06', 45, 3.2, 12, '/4XKRcGXj8eQKyiVmS8k2LFZ5lGO.jpg', None, 'cd236fe59a19473482bff6653e43cefc', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893631, 4, 'Safe', \"June appeals to the victim's mother to help combat the vicious rumors spread by Cosmo and his followers.\", '2026-05-13', 46, 3.7, 13, '/jlKZjtHtgg2YwzkIP06DhRnrum4.jpg', None, 'fe0be533d9e946a3af2bf63e75c831d3', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893632, 5, 'Duty of Care', \"Hegarty continues the hunt for the detonators. June comes to a shocking realization. Cosmo's off-the-grid boot camp takes a deadly turn.\", '2026-05-20', 38, 3.917, 12, '/51vedAiey8JYEzj7BemUuEIoEHK.jpg', None, '52b08108179349d5bf313e25a8775f9c', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893633, 6, 'When the Music Stops', 'After the chaos in the woods, Billy goes dark and Operation Samphire hangs by a thread.', '2026-05-27', 44, 3.2, 10, '/lNEbWztuTX0KLGjDwEoX0BvYcpk.jpg', None, 'ae2c3df491be4a46891dc29a0fd81e38', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893634, 7, 'Going Down', \"June is calling the shots now, as the team gets information about Cosmo's next move.\", '2026-06-03', 40, 3.0, 11, '/i7tJgxhJEx8rIn0zk7mme9CbbS0.jpg', None, 'dad59a93b5154e71a33c345549afde41', 'ac27cfa69e24435397f1e7def20656dd', 6893635, 8, 'Nobody Dies', 'June and Hegarty must work together to stop the danger already set in motion.', '2026-06-10', 44, 3.222, 9, '/wUVGm33rzLuY6ArZ8RYVemazRA5.jpg', None)"}
